Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.12,0:00:05.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(独家: 面对银行犯罪团伙 警方毫无头绪)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.90,0:00:08.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(十八个月前)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:28.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(谁偷了我们的两百万?)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.68,0:00:34.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(十二个月前)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.90,0:00:46.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(离沃特斯兄弟定罪尚远  警方仍无进展)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.21,0:00:52.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(六个月前)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.79,0:01:00.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(沃特斯兄弟如入无人之境 再次逍遥法外)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.98,0:01:04.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(三个月前)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.99,0:01:27.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(昨天)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(所有警报解除)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.68,0:01:41.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(警报离线)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.04,0:01:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(发现黑客袭击)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.52,0:02:36.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(救命 贝克街 现在)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.62,0:02:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(救救我 拜托了)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.43,0:03:23.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.04,0:03:48.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《神探夏洛克》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.27,0:04:29.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《三签名》
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.13,0:29:09.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(浴血卫兵)
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.96,0:43:31.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(蜉蝣男)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.81,0:47:04.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(夏洛克  福尔摩斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.99,0:47:07.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(麦当娜)
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.55,0:51:58.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(名家出品 桌子 艺术?)
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.97,0:52:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(椅子 座位 皮毛 睡觉)
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.17,0:52:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(发言人 事件 电子狂人)
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.24,0:52:06.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(死亡? 头骨? 去世?)
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.06,0:52:08.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(木头? 无名氏? 烟斗/管子/匿名者)
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.90,0:52:10.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(鸡蛋? 椅子? 用来坐的?)
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.60,0:52:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(护士? 毛衣外套 顾客 受害人?)
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.32,0:56:45.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(他毁了所有人  而且还为此得到了勋章)
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.32,0:56:48.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(没有答案的问题:为什么我的孩子会死去?)
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.02,0:59:08.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.94,0:59:52.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(混蛋!)
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.54,1:08:48.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(封锁这个地方)
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.50,1:11:25.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.51,1:11:44.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(地点)
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.72,1:11:50.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(计划)
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.12,1:11:55.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(彩排)
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.74,1:24:26.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.53,1:24:35.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.18,0:00:10.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们竟然就这样被无罪释放了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just walked out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.12,0:00:11.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我知道 当时我就坐在你旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know, I was sort of sitting next to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.94,0:00:15.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沃特斯兄弟 他们竟然就这样被无罪释放了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole Waters family. They just walked right out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.06,0:00:17.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 再说一次 我当时也在场  - 他们究竟怎么做到的?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Again, I was in the room.  - How do they always manage that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.53,0:00:19.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.97,0:00:21.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们很贪婪 还会再次作案的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're greedy and they'll do it again,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:24.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一次 我们要把他们抓个现行\N{\fnArial\fs30}and next time we're going to catch them in the act.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.05,0:00:25.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么抓?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.65,0:00:35.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是没抓到?\N{\fnArial\fs30}No good?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.61,0:00:38.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们总是知道我们要来了 他们到底是怎么知道的?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}They always know we're coming. How do they always know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.69,0:00:41.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们很聪明 也很擅长\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're good, they work at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.01,0:00:43.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们永远不会停下  - 我们也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're never going to stop.  - Well, neither are we.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.58,0:01:11.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格雷格...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greg...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:13.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓现行!\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the act!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.74,0:01:17.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们唯一的方法 抓现行!\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way we're going to do this, in the act!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.86,0:01:48.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们还屏蔽着警报装置?\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still blocking it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.74,0:01:51.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 很有效的黑客技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Very efficiently hacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.02,0:01:53.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们一定满意得要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must be bloody pleased with themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.58,0:01:55.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.54,0:02:02.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在行动?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.98,0:02:06.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不! 不 您来负责这次逮捕行动 这是您的功劳 头儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, no! No, you've got to make the arrest. This one's yours, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.46,0:02:08.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以前从没叫过我"头儿"\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never called me boss before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.62,0:02:11.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 今天我心情非常好 所以才叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, look what happens when you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:14.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也知道没几天好心情的日子吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how most days aren't good days?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.26,0:02:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 今天是个好日子  - 不过对沃特斯团伙来说可不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is a good day.  - Not for the Waters family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.50,0:02:19.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 屋顶安排了十个人 所有出口都有人把手\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, ten men on the roof, all exits covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:22.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,银行关门了 因此我们不用担心有人质\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bank's closed, so we've no hostages to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.90,0:02:24.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 继续 继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, no, go on. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.42,0:02:26.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我们在隧道入口处也安排了人手...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, we've got the tunnel entrance covered...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.66,0:02:28.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大卫斯 魏楼 克里斯蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Davies, Willow and Christie
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.26,0:02:30.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在马弗京路上指挥武装部队响应\N{\fnArial\fs30}are heading up armed response on Mafeking Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.94,0:02:33.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 我还是得看一下手机  - 是他 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, I'd better get this.  - It's him, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.54,0:02:42.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我... 我得走了  - 什么?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I, I, I have to go.  - What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.11,0:02:43.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你来逮捕他们  - 不可能!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You make the arrest.  - No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.43,0:02:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 你能做到 不用管我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, you'll be fine. I'm cool with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.55,0:02:48.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你现在走了 琼斯就会抢了所有功劳 你知道他就是这种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jones will get all the credit if you leave now, you know he will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.87,0:02:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 没关系了 我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, yeah, it doesn't matter, I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:02:58.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请求支援! 我需要最大警力支援!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back up! I need maximum back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.95,0:03:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝克街 马上!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baker Street now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.43,0:03:14.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出了什么事?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.63,0:03:16.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这很难  - 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is hard.  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.55,0:03:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很难 这是我做过最难的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really hard. Hardest thing I've ever had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.47,0:03:24.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道什么约翰的趣事吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know any funny stories about John?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.99,0:03:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.07,0:03:31.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要趣闻轶事 你没惹麻烦吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need anecdotes. Didn't go to any trouble, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.79,0:05:02.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 哈德森太太  - 我一个字都没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up, Mrs Hudson.  - I haven't said a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.15,0:05:04.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在组织语言问一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're formulating a question,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.19,0:05:06.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你思考的过程 我觉得很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's physically painful watching you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.67,0:05:08.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为是你在拉小提琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was you playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.59,0:05:09.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实是我拉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was me playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.75,0:05:12.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在作曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am composing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.23,0:05:14.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚才在跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.63,0:05:16.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚才在做实地测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was road-testing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.11,0:05:17.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.31,0:05:19.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么来了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.15,0:05:22.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你端了点早茶 你总是睡不醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm bringing you your morning tea. You're not usually awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.99,0:05:24.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还给我端早茶了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bring me tea in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.43,0:05:26.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊 不然你觉得它是从哪来的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, where do you think it came from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.19,0:05:28.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道 我只是觉得它就这么出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I just thought it sort of happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.59,0:05:30.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你母亲可要负很大责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother has a lot to answer for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.23,0:05:32.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我知道 我有一清单的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, I know. I have a list.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.79,0:05:34.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦考罗夫特的责任有一个文件夹那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft has a file.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.99,0:05:38.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是个大日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it's the big day then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.03,0:05:40.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么大日子?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What big day?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.19,0:05:43.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,婚礼! 约翰和玛丽要结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wedding! John and Mary getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.75,0:05:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来就生活在一起的两个人要进教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two people who currently live together are about to attend church,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.59,0:05:49.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开派对 进行短途旅游 然后继续生活在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}have a party, go on a short holiday, then carry on living together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.47,0:05:51.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这样有什么重大可言?  - 婚姻会改变人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's big about that?  - It changes people, marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.75,0:05:53.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 不 不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, no it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.35,0:05:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不懂的 因为你都是一个人生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you wouldn't understand, cos you always live alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.63,0:05:59.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的丈夫因双重谋杀被处决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your husband was executed for double murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.87,0:06:02.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不可能是婚姻的支持者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hardly an advert for companionship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.07,0:06:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,婚姻用你无法想象的方式改变你的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marriage changes you as a person in ways that you can't imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.79,0:06:07.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注射处死也有同样的效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}As does lethal injection.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.31,0:06:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最好的朋友玛格丽特 是我的首席伴娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}My best friend, Margaret, she was my chief bridesmaid,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.75,0:06:14.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们过去总说 我们永远是最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were going to be best friends forever, we always said that,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.11,0:06:15.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我结婚后就几乎没见过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I hardly saw her after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:18.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不是一般还有饼干吗?  - 吃完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aren't there usually biscuits?  - I've run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.43,0:06:18.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,店里也卖完了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have the shops?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.55,0:06:22.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她哭了一整天 说道"哦 过去一去不复返"\N{\fnArial\fs30}She cried the whole day, saying, "Ooh, it's the end of an era."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.15,0:06:23.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我确定拐角的商店是开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure the shop on the corner is open.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.91,0:06:27.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她可能说对了 真的 我记得她走得很早\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was probably right, really. I remember she left early.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.63,0:06:31.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说 谁会在婚礼上早走呢? 真伤心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, who leaves a wedding early? So sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.83,0:06:34.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 不管怎样 你还有事要忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Anyway, you've got things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.19,0:06:37.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没有 我有很多时间准备...  - 饼干!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, not really. I've got plenty of time to get ready...  - Biscuits!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.27,0:06:40.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦! 我真的要去和你母亲谈一谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! I really am going to have a word with your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.27,0:06:42.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你想的话可以 不过她基本不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can if you like, she understands very little.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.83,0:07:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.31,0:07:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上战场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.55,0:08:16.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.27,0:08:20.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 就站那儿 给新婚夫妇来张合影\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, hold it there, I want to get this shot of the newlyweds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.15,0:08:22.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 只有新郎和新娘 伴郎麻烦请让让\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, just the bride and groom, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:26.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克...  - 哦 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock...  - Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.43,0:08:29.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 三 二 一 茄子\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, three, two, one, cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.79,0:08:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大名鼎鼎的福尔摩斯先生 很高兴认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The famous Mr Holmes. I'm very pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.07,0:08:45.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不过不做爱 好吗?  - 什么?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But no sex, OK?  - Sorry?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.39,0:08:48.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别吓坏了 我只是开个玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to look so scared, I'm only messing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.67,0:08:52.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伴娘 伴郎 这是传统节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridesmaid, best man, it's a bit traditional.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.31,0:08:54.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是吗?  - 不过不是必须的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it?  - But not obligatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.95,0:08:58.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你想要来场艳遇 那边穿蓝衬衫的男人是最有可能成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's the sort of thing you're looking for, the man over there in blue is your best bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.47,0:09:00.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近刚离婚的医生 有一只姜黄色的猫...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recently divorced doctor with a ginger cat...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.75,0:09:04.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一处改建房 曾经阳痿\N{\fnArial\fs30}a barn conversion and a history of erectile dysfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.03,0:09:06.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考虑到这一点 可能不是你的最佳选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reviewing that information, possibly not your best bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.51,0:09:07.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 可能不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.91,0:09:10.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 比我预想的多推理出了一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, there was one more deduction there than I was expecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.63,0:09:14.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯先生 你会发挥非常大的作用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Holmes, you're going to be incredibly useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.07,0:09:24.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Lovely to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.27,0:09:26.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好  - 真漂亮 玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How are you?  - Beautiful, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.07,0:09:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢  - 恭喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you.  - Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.07,0:09:29.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大卫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}David!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.11,0:09:33.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 玛丽 恭喜你 你看上去很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, ah, Mary. Congratulations, you look, um, very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.87,0:09:36.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢  - 约翰 恭喜你 你很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks.  - John, congratulations. You're a lucky man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.53,0:09:37.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.15,0:09:40.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗯 大卫 这是夏洛克  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Um, David, this is Sherlock.  - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.75,0:09:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 我们... 我们已经见过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, yeah, we've um... We've met.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.27,0:09:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 我做引导员具体是做什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what exactly are my duties as an usher?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.51,0:09:54.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们先谈谈玛丽吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk about Mary first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.83,0:09:56.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 你说什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.27,0:09:59.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你知道我在说什么 你和玛丽谈过两年恋爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think you know what. You went out with her for two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.95,0:10:02.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多年前的事了 我们... 我们现在只是好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, ages ago. We're... We're just good friends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.31,0:10:03.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是个事实吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a fact?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.55,0:10:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次她发推特 你总在5分钟内回复 不论时间地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever she tweets, you respond within five minutes, regardless of time or current location,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.75,0:10:11.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这表明你设置她为短信提醒对象 在你的脸谱上关于这对新婚夫妇的照片里\N{\fnArial\fs30}suggesting you have her on text alert. In your Facebook photographs of the happy couple,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.47,0:10:14.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽总在最中间 而约翰只出现半边或完全没出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary takes centre frame, whereas John is always partly or entirely excluded.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.91,0:10:18.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能从那些就说我还对玛丽有兴趣...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you can't assume from that I've still got some kind of interest in Mary...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.75,0:10:22.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在至少三次不同的情况下 主动安抚玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You volunteered to be a shoulder to cry on on no less than three separate occasions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.27,0:10:24.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还要辩护吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have anything to say in your defence?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.95,0:10:27.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想从现在起 你们会保持距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think from now on, we'll downgrade you to casual acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.91,0:10:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每年会面不超过三次 都要经过事先计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more than three planned social encounters a year
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.35,0:10:32.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而约翰每次都要在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}and always in John's presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.19,0:10:34.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有你的联系方式 我会盯着你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have your contact details. I will be monitoring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.35,0:10:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说得没错 你他妈就是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're right about you. You're a bloody psychopath.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.43,0:10:43.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超强功能反社会人士 还有你的号码哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}High functioning sociopath, with your number.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.11,0:10:55.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.99,0:11:00.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好 亲爱的  - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. Darling.  - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.19,0:11:02.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你简直美翻了  - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You look fabulous.  - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.39,0:11:04.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你能来 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for coming, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.31,0:11:08.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真棒 工作很出色 阿尔奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, yes, well done in the service, Archie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.75,0:11:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他真的变得开朗了 我不知道你怎么做到的  - 嗯...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's really come out of his shell. I don't know how you did it.  - Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.47,0:11:19.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基本上就是给新娘一个灿烂的微笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically it's a cute smile to the bride's side,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.71,0:11:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 给新郎一个灿烂的微笑 然后就拿出戒指  - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- cute smile to the groom's side and then the rings.  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.07,0:11:23.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还得穿礼服  - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you have to wear the outfit.  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.71,0:11:25.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你真的得穿上礼服  - 为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You really do have to wear the outfit.  - What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.71,0:11:28.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 成年人喜欢这样的东西  - 为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grown-ups like that sort of thing.  - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.63,0:11:30.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道 我会找人问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, I'll ask one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.75,0:11:33.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.15,0:11:35.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没错  - 你侦破过谋杀案吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yep.  - Have you solved any murders?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.75,0:11:37.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 当然 一大堆  - 我能看看吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure, loads.  - Can I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.47,0:11:40.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.91,0:11:49.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他眼睛里都是些什么东西?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's all the stuff in his eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.71,0:11:52.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 蛆  - 真酷!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maggots.  - Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.43,0:11:53.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.71,0:11:56.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说你会给他一些照片 作为奖励?\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said you had some pictures for him, as a treat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.47,0:11:58.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 如果他表现不错的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, yes, if he's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.67,0:12:01.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 砍头的照片  - 是个可爱的小村子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Beheadings.  - Lovely little village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.23,0:12:03.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯? 你刚才说了什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm? What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.35,0:12:09.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笑一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.71,0:12:12.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.35,0:12:19.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我快饿疯了  - 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm starving.  - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.47,0:12:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我减了好多斤 就为了塞进这条裙子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to lose so much weight to get into this dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.51,0:12:25.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 他看着不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, he's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.63,0:12:29.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有两款著名除臭剂的味道 都以强效出名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traces of two leading brands of deodorant, both advertised for their strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.19,0:12:32.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,表明他有狐臭 压力较大\N{\fnArial\fs30}suggestive of a chronic body odour problem, manifesting under stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.39,0:12:35.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 打住 他朋友呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, done there. What about his friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:41.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 长期外遇 经常对妻子不忠  - 真的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Long-term relationship, compulsive cheat.  - Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.35,0:12:43.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的智能手机用了防水外壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waterproof cover on his smart-phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.59,0:12:46.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他的面色却表明他并不是做户外工作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet his complexion doesn't indicate outdoor work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.63,0:12:49.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这说明他习惯把手机带进浴室\N{\fnArial\fs30}It suggests he's in the habit of taking his phone into the shower with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.79,0:12:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 也就是说他经常收一些短信和邮件 不想让老婆看见  - 我能选你吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- which means he often receives texts and emails he'd rather went unseen.  - Can I keep you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.55,0:12:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢破案吗?  - 你有空吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you like solving crimes?  - Do you have a vacancy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.79,0:12:59.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哈利来了吗?  - 呃 没 还没来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, Harry?  - Er, no. No show.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.67,0:13:01.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的 真遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darling, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.15,0:13:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得让她帮忙带话还是有点悬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it was a bit of a punt asking her, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.11,0:13:06.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过自助式酒吧本来就不怎么靠谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, free bar, wouldn't have been a good mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.71,0:13:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 哇!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. God, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.75,0:13:13.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他就是...?  - 他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that...?  - He came.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.75,0:13:21.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那就是他了 肖尔托少校  - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So that's him, Major Sholto.  - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.95,0:13:27.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他们真是那么好的朋友 为什么他基本不提起他?\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they're such good friends, why does he barely even mention him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.83,0:13:31.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一直对我提起他 一提起就滔滔不绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}He mentions him all the time to me, never shuts up about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.27,0:13:33.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 提起他?  - 对呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- About him?  - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.39,0:13:35.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊! 我怎么会选这种酒 真是难喝得要命!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Urgh! I chose this wine, it's bloody awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.83,0:13:38.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没错 确定他提起的就是他?  - 对呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, but it's definitely him that he talks about?  - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.71,0:13:41.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常非常高兴见到您 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very, very, glad to see you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.03,0:13:46.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你一般不参加这样的聚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you don't really do this sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.11,0:13:48.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会参加老朋友的 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I do for old friends, Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.43,0:13:50.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.19,0:13:52.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你  - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's good to see you.  - You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.07,0:13:56.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你挺适应社会生活的嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Civilian life suiting you, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.99,0:14:00.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 呃 是吧 我想是吧 长官  - 不需要再去看心里医生了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Er, er, yes. Well, I think so, Sir.  - No more need for the trick cyclist?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.83,0:14:03.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要了 不过我还是时不时会去 算是调整心态\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I go now and then. Sort of a top-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:07.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,疗养很有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therapy can be very helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.03,0:14:12.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些年你住在哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you living these days?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.87,0:14:16.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很偏僻的小地方 你不会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, way out in the middle of nowhere. You wouldn't know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.07,0:14:18.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你的气色不错...  - 我从来没听过他提起他的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You look well...  - I've never even heard him say his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.51,0:14:21.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他基本上算隐居了 自从...  - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, he's almost a recluse, you know, since...  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.91,0:14:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来以为他不会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think he'd show up at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.75,0:14:25.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰说他是他认识的最不爱社交的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}John says he's the most unsociable man he's ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.99,0:14:28.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是吗? 他是最不爱社交的?  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He is? He's the most unsociable?  - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.03,0:14:31.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难怪他蹦蹦跳跳地像条小狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, that's why he's bouncing around him like a puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.55,0:14:33.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 夏洛克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.67,0:14:37.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们俩都不是他的初恋  - 别笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Neither of us were the first, you know.  - Stop smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.07,0:14:39.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天可是我的大喜日子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my wedding day!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.95,0:14:44.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Urgh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.43,0:15:15.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂? 怎么了 夏洛克?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes? What, Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.11,0:15:17.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你怎么气喘吁吁的?  - 整理文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why are you out of breath?  - Filing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.23,0:15:21.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要么你正好被人挟持 要么就又在锻炼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either I've caught you in a compromising position or you've been working out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.07,0:15:23.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我更倾向于后者  - 你有什么事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I favour the latter.  - What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.07,0:15:25.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你回答我 迈克罗夫特 紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your answer, Mycroft, as a matter of urgency.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.67,0:15:29.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 回答?  - 即使是最后时刻也不算太晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Answer?  - Even at the eleventh hour, it's not too late, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.63,0:15:30.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.79,0:15:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以订车 私人飞机也随时待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cars can be ordered, private jets commandeered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.99,0:15:36.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天 就是今天了 对吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today. It's today, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.95,0:15:40.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 夏洛克 我不会去那个晚上的活动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sherlock, I will not be coming to the night-do,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.19,0:15:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你怎么叫它\N{\fnArial\fs30}as you so poetically put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.87,0:15:45.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可惜 玛丽和约翰肯定会非常...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a shame. Mary and John will be extremely d...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.79,0:15:48.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常高兴我没去乱转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delighted not to have me hanging around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.75,0:15:50.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不一定吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.19,0:15:53.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宴会上总会有个幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}There should always be a spectre at the feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.31,0:15:56.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是今天了? 婚礼的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is it, then? The big day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.71,0:15:59.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜从今天开始我能常常见到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose I'll be seeing a lot more of you from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:02.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你什么意思?  - 就像以前一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean?  - Just like old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.27,0:16:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不懂  - 这是一个时代的终结 不是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I don't understand.  - Well, it's the end of an era, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.79,0:16:08.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰和玛丽享受家庭的幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}John and Mary, domestic bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.83,0:16:12.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不 不 我更愿意把这当做是新篇章的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. I prefer to think of it as the beginning of a new chapter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.03,0:16:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了?  - 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?  - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.39,0:16:17.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道那种沉默的意思 到底怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that silence. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.55,0:16:19.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最好让你回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'd better let you get back to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.27,0:16:21.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有个演讲之类的事要做 不是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a big speech or something, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.87,0:16:25.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 蛋糕加上唱歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?  - Cakes, karaoke, mingling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.39,0:16:28.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 迈克罗夫特!  - 人们就是这样的 夏洛克 他们会结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mycroft!  - This is what people do, Sherlock. They get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.75,0:16:31.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我警告过你 别牵扯进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I warned you, don't get involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.47,0:16:33.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 牵扯进去? 我没有 - 没有吗...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Involved? I'm not involved.  - No...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.43,0:16:35.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰让我给他当伴郎 我怎么能拒绝?\N{\fnArial\fs30}John asked me to be his best man, how could I say no?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.51,0:16:36.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是啊  - 我当然没有牵扯进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Absolutely.  - I'm not involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.87,0:16:39.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信你 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you. Really, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.03,0:16:42.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好玩吧 把我的祝福带给那对幸福的新人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a lovely day and do give the happy couple my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.11,0:16:45.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.35,0:16:49.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺便说问一句 夏洛克 你还记得"红胡子"吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, by the way, Sherlock, do you remember Redbeard?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.83,0:16:54.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是小孩子了 迈克罗夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a child anymore, Mycroft.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.03,0:16:56.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当然不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, of course you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.07,0:16:58.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好享受不被牵扯去的感觉吧 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy not getting involved, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.67,0:17:22.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请大家安静一下 伴郎要致辞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pray silence for the best man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.27,0:17:32.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.47,0:17:35.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家人和朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}family and friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.03,0:17:37.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.51,0:17:40.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}um, others.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.31,0:17:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.59,0:17:53.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还... 还有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}A... also...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.87,0:17:58.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 格雷格...  - 茉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Greg...  - Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.90,0:18:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just had a thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.43,0:18:01.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是个大脑吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.51,0:18:03.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是约翰让夏洛克当他的伴郎怎么办?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if John asks Sherlock to be his best man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.63,0:18:05.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他肯定会这样做的 不是吗? 他本来就是最好的  - 正是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, he will, won't he? He's best.  - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.99,0:18:10.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 所以呢?  - 所以他就得在众人面前做一个演讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So?  - So, he'll have to make a speech, in front of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.27,0:18:13.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时候会有真的人坐在那里 真的要听他说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}There'll be actual people there, actually listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.03,0:18:17.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 最坏的可能是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what's the worst that could happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.23,0:18:19.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海伦·路易斯也想问同样的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helen Louise probably wondered the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.47,0:18:21.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helen Louise?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.11,0:18:28.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hello dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.47,0:18:30.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚刚在想 如果约翰真的让夏洛克...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just thinking, if John does ask Sherlock...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.91,0:18:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 演讲? 不用担心 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, the speech, dear? No, it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.99,0:18:36.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是不仅仅是演讲啊 不是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just the speech, though, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.23,0:18:46.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真聪明!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.67,0:18:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哈德森太太?  - 嗨 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mrs. Hudson?  - Hello, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.56,0:18:49.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.83,0:18:52.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是过来看望夏洛克的 然后我觉得你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was coming to see Sherlock and I thought you were...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.39,0:18:54.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没...  - 可能要挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No...  - Possibly dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.87,0:18:56.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.91,0:18:59.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.35,0:19:01.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电报!\N{\fnArial\fs30}The telegrams!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.95,0:19:03.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 你说什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.47,0:19:06.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.95,0:19:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电报!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Telegrams!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.19,0:19:14.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 呃...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.31,0:19:18.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先是最重要的事 读电报\N{\fnArial\fs30}First things first, telegrams.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.27,0:19:21.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 它们不是真的电报 我们只是把它们叫做电报 我也不知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're not actually telegrams, we just call them telegrams. I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.75,0:19:23.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是婚礼传统吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wedding tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.47,0:19:26.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为显然我们还没厌倦这传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we don't have enough of that already, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.87,0:19:27.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"致华生夫妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To Mr and Mrs Watson,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.95,0:19:30.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常抱歉我不能在你们大婚的日子陪在你们身旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}so sorry I am unable to be with you on your special day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.67,0:19:33.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你们好运 一切顺利 麦克·斯坦福"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck and best wishes, Mike Stanford."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.87,0:19:36.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"约翰和玛丽 祝你们新婚愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To John and Mary, all good wishes for your special day,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.59,0:19:38.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请接受我的爱 以及许多大大的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}with love and many big...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.79,0:19:41.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来自史黛拉和泰德的黏糊糊的拥抱"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big squishy cuddles from Stella and Ted."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.07,0:19:47.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"玛丽 我的小..."\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Mary, lots of love..."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.15,0:19:48.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.99,0:19:53.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"小宝贝 请接受来自卡姆的满满的爱意和真挚的祝福"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Poppet. Oodles of love and heaps of good wishes from Cam."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.95,0:19:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"希望你的家人也能在场"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Wish your family could have seen this."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.27,0:20:01.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"特殊的日子..." "非常特殊的日子..."\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Special day..." "Very special day..."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.95,0:20:04.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"爱..." "爱..." "爱..." "爱..." "爱..."\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Love..." "Love..." "Love..." "Love..." "Love..."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:07.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主题都差不多 你知道我的意思吧 人们都挺喜欢说那些话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit of a theme, you get the general gist. People are basically fond.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.95,0:20:12.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰·华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.71,0:20:16.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的朋友 约翰·华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend, John Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.23,0:20:20.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰...\N{\fnArial\fs30}John...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.27,0:20:23.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当约翰第一次说起让我当伴郎的时候 我有点没明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}When John first broached the subject of being best man, I was confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.79,0:20:26.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克?  - 楼下怎么那么吵?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock?  - What was that noise downstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.39,0:20:27.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 是哈德森太太在笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it was Mrs. Hudson laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.79,0:20:30.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 听起来像是她在折磨猫头鹰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, it sounded like she was torturing an owl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.03,0:20:32.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 不过那是笑声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, it was laughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.19,0:20:33.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could have been both.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.39,0:20:35.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在忙吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.75,0:20:39.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是分散下注意力 有时候觉得戒烟太难了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, just occupying myself. Sometimes it's so hard not smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.87,0:20:42.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,介意我打断一下吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind if I interrupt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.11,0:20:43.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.31,0:20:48.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喝茶吗?  - 算了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tea?  - Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.39,0:20:51.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 呃 说正事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, er, the big question.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.35,0:20:52.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.15,0:20:56.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伴郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.11,0:20:57.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好的人?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best man?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.47,0:20:59.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你觉得呢?  - 比利·金凯德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you think?  - Billy Kincaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.75,0:21:02.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你说什么?  - 比利·金凯德 来自"卡姆登绞杀者" 他是我认识的最好的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, what?  - Billy Kincaid, the Camden Garrotter, best man I ever knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.83,0:21:04.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为慈善事业做出巨大贡献 而且从不招摇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vast contributions to charity, never disclosed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.99,0:21:07.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他以一己之力使得三个医院没有倒闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Personally managed to save three hospitals from closure
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.83,0:21:10.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还经营着英国北部最好也最安全的孤儿院\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ran the best and safest children's homes in north England.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.95,0:21:15.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实 现在他也还会绞死别人 不过他杀死的人相比于救过的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, every now and again there'd be some garrotings, but stacking up the lives saved against the garrotings,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.51,0:21:17.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我倒觉得他...  - 是我的婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- on balance I'd say he...  - For my wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.75,0:21:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我 我需要一个伴郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me, I need a best man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.35,0:21:21.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好吧  - 可能绞杀者不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, right.  - Maybe not a garrotter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.71,0:21:24.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 盖文怎么样?  - 谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gavin?  - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.23,0:21:27.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盖文·雷斯垂德? 他是个男人 而且很善于这些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gavin Lestrade? He's a man and good at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.27,0:21:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫格雷格 但他不是我最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Greg. And he's not my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.27,0:21:31.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白了 那就麦克·斯坦福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mike Stanford, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.99,0:21:35.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 他挺好的 呃 不过我不确定他能不能对付...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's nice. Um, though I'm not sure how well he'd cope with all...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.19,0:21:37.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 麦克很好 但他也不是我最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Mike's great, but he's not my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.07,0:21:43.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 夏洛克 这是我人生中最重要的一天...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Sherlock, this is the biggest and most important day of my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.79,0:21:46.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 其实...  - 我不管 我说是就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well...  - No, it is. It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.31,0:21:48.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我希望我在这世上最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want to be up there with the two people
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.63,0:21:52.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 也最在意的两个人都能在场  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that I love and care about most in the world.  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.71,0:21:57.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 一个是玛丽·摩斯坦  - 对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So Mary Morstan...  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.47,0:22:01.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有就是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.63,0:22:06.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.47,0:22:12.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我承认一开始我没意识到他是在邀请我当伴郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I confess at first I didn't realise he was asking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.03,0:22:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我明白过来的时候 我表现出了受宠若惊以及惊讶之情\N{\fnArial\fs30}When finally I understood, I expressed to him that I was both flattered and surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.87,0:22:24.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟他解释 我完全没想到过这件事 而且我的表情有点像是被吓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I explained to him that I'd never expected this request and I was a little daunted in the face of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.91,0:22:26.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.03,0:22:33.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我也保证 我会尽我最大的努力完成这个 对我来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I nonetheless promised I would do my very best to accomplish a task which was, for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.67,0:22:36.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和以往一样高难度的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}as demanding and difficult as any I had ever contemplated.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.11,0:22:39.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除此之外 我很感谢他对我的信任 而且我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Additionally, I thanked him for the trust he placed in me and indicated that I was,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.95,0:22:43.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从某种程度上说 差点就要被感动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in some ways, very close to being moved by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.35,0:22:50.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样 你有点吓人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's getting a bit scary now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.31,0:22:52.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来事实证明这些我一个字都没说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It later transpired that I'd said none of this out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.75,0:23:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 其实...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, in fact...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.15,0:23:06.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你 你是说...  - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You, you mean...  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.67,0:23:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是你的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.11,0:23:10.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}best...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.99,0:23:13.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 伴郎...  - 朋友?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Man...  - Friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.71,0:23:16.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 你当然是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, of course you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.75,0:23:21.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当然... 是我最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course... you're my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.83,0:23:32.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.79,0:23:34.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprisingly OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.63,0:23:39.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你显然得做个演讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you'll have to make a speech, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.43,0:23:49.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说过了 说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done that. Done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.59,0:23:51.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个也差不多 那个算说过了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done that bit, done that bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.43,0:23:54.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个也说过了 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done that bit. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.11,0:23:58.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰 恐怕我不能祝贺你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid, John, I can't congratulate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.59,0:24:00.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的情感 尤其是爱情\N{\fnArial\fs30}All emotions, and in particular love,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.83,0:24:04.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都与我最重视的纯粹冷酷的理性相悖\N{\fnArial\fs30}stand opposed to the pure, cold reason I hold above all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.19,0:24:06.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我看来 婚礼不过就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wedding is, in my considered opinion,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.55,0:24:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个在道德妥协的世界对错误的 表面化的 非理性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing short of a celebration of all that is false and specious and irrational
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.19,0:24:14.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和情感上的事的庆祝罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sentimental in this ailing and morally compromised world.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.23,0:24:17.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我们纪念的报死窃蠹就是我们社会最终的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today we honour the deathwatch beetle that is the doom of our society,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.55,0:24:20.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且很快 我敢肯定 整个人类社会都会如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in time, one feels certain, our entire species.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.75,0:24:31.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不过 不管怎么说 还是来说说约翰  - 请吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But anyway, let's talk about John.  - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.47,0:24:34.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我让一个助手成为我冒险途中的负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I burden myself with a little helpmate during my adventures,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.39,0:24:38.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这并不是感情用事或者任性 而是因为他身上有许多优秀的品格\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is not out of sentiment or caprice, it is that he has many fine qualities of his own
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.31,0:24:41.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而他自己都因为迷恋我而没有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he has overlooked in his obsession with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.03,0:24:44.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实 任何关于我思维敏捷清晰的声望都来自于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed, any reputation I have for mental acuity and sharpness comes, in truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.55,0:24:47.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出色的约翰为我做出的无的奉献\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the extraordinary contrast John so selflessly provides.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.75,0:24:52.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上 我觉得今天的新娘比较喜欢特别平庸的伴娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a fact, I believe, that brides tend to favour exceptionally plain bridesmaids for their big day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.03,0:24:55.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个类比 不过不同的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a certain analogy there, I feel. And contrast is, after all,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.51,0:24:58.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝会加强他所造之物的美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's own plan to enhance the beauty of his creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.27,0:25:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则上帝就是个用来给家里的白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it would be if God were not a ludicrous fantasy
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.71,0:25:03.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提供就业机会的可笑幻想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}designed to provide a career opportunity for the family idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.03,0:25:09.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想说的是 我是个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point I'm trying to make is that I am
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.79,0:25:13.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最招人烦 最粗鲁无礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most unpleasant, rude,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.75,0:25:16.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自大傲慢 十恶不赦的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}ignorant and all-round obnoxious arsehole
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.59,0:25:19.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何人遇到我都算是不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}that anyone could possibly have the misfortune to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.95,0:25:22.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我蔑视美德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am dismissive of the virtuous,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.43,0:25:24.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忽视美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}unaware of the beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.51,0:25:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且不能理解快乐的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}and uncomprehending in the face of the happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.27,0:25:30.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以如果我不能明白被邀请作为伴郎是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if I didn't understand I was being asked to be best man,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.83,0:25:34.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是因为我从没想到过 我能成为别人最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is because I never expected to be anybody's best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.51,0:25:37.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且当然不可能是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And certainly not the best friend
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.75,0:25:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这世上我遇到过的 最勇敢善良有智慧的人的好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the bravest and kindest and wisest human being
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.07,0:25:43.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遇到他是我最大的幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have ever had the good fortune of knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.43,0:25:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰 我是个古怪的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, I am a ridiculous man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.35,0:25:51.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能被你长久以来温暖的友情感化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Redeemed only by the warmth and constancy of your friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.67,0:25:53.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 虽然我是你最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, as I am apparently your best friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.75,0:25:56.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能为你选择的伴侣而祝贺你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot congratulate you on your choice of companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.39,0:26:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实 我想我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, now I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.67,0:26:06.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽 当我说你配得上这个男人的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary, when I say you deserve this man,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.19,0:26:09.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我能给予你的最高的赞美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is the highest compliment of which I am capable.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.83,0:26:16.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰 你经历过战争 伤痛 还失去过重要的人...\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, you have endured war and injury and tragic loss...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.51,0:26:21.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再次为那件事道歉... 所以你要知道 今天你正坐在\N{\fnArial\fs30}so sorry again about that last one... so know this, today you sit between
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.39,0:26:25.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的夫人和你拯救过的人之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}the woman you have made your wife and the man you have saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.63,0:26:29.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是这世界上最爱你的两个人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In short, the two people who love you most in all this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.75,0:26:32.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我知道我可以代表玛丽说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know I speak for Mary as well when I say,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.19,0:26:35.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们绝不会让你失望 而且我们会用一辈子去证明这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will never let you down and we have a lifetime ahead to prove that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.11,0:26:42.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 要是我想拥抱他 拦住我  - 我才不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If I try and hug him, stop me.  - Certainly not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.15,0:26:47.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 好了 现在来说说有关约翰的趣事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes. Now onto some funny stories about John.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.47,0:26:53.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了? 什么情况? 你们都怎么了? 约翰?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong? What happened? Why are you all doing that? John?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.71,0:26:55.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.51,0:26:58.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我出错了吗?  - 不 没有 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did I do it wrong?  - No, you didn't. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.59,0:27:03.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我还没说完呢  - 是 我知道 知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I haven't finished yet.  - Yeah, I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.11,0:27:06.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那么我们来说点有趣的事...  - 能不能至少等我坐下再说?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So onto some funny stories now...  - Can you wait till I sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.15,0:27:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来说点有关约翰的趣闻轶事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, onto some funny stories about John.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.91,0:27:23.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要是能开心点就再好不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could all just cheer up a bit, that would be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.11,0:27:24.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}On we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.27,0:27:29.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好玩的事 不能不说说约翰的博客\N{\fnArial\fs30}So for funny stories, one has to look no further than John's blog.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.87,0:27:31.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们共同生活的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}The record of our time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.75,0:27:34.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 他有点夸张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, he does tend to romanticise things a bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.11,0:27:36.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 大家都知道 他本来就是个爱幻想的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}but then, you know, he's a romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.27,0:27:39.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们处理了一些奇怪的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've tackled some strange cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.59,0:27:41.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空心客户...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hollow Client...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.83,0:27:49.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毒巨人...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Poison Giant...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.71,0:27:55.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,低头 约翰!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down, John!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.95,0:28:03.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也有过一些令人沮丧的案子...\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've had some frustrating cases...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.35,0:28:10.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.55,0:28:13.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一个法国十项全能运动员疯了 被发现的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}A French decathlete found completely out of his mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.11,0:28:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的身边有1821个火柴盒\N{\fnArial\fs30}surrounded by 1,812 matchboxes,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.15,0:28:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了这个都是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}all empty except this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.67,0:28:19.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个里面有什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's in that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.43,0:28:23.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难以言表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inexplicable.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.59,0:28:28.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有令人感动的案件...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touching cases...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.91,0:28:31.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她要按门铃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's going to ring the doorbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.55,0:28:36.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 她改变主意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. She's changed her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.27,0:28:40.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她又要来按了 她反悔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she's going to do it. No, she's leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.11,0:28:42.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她走了 她又回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's leaving. Oh, she's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.23,0:28:46.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她是个无聊的客户 我以前见过这情况  - 然后?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's a client, she's boring. I've seen those symptoms before.  - Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.47,0:28:50.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在街道上徘徊通常意味着是爱情方面的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oscillation on the pavement always means there's a love affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.07,0:28:53.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然还要提一下房间里的大象...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And of course I have to mention the elephant in the room...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.19,0:28:59.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这个特殊的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we want something
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.47,0:29:02.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该要分享些特殊事件 不是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}very particular for this special day, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.47,0:29:05.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,浴血卫兵...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bloody Guardsman...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.11,0:29:12.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽 你忙着结婚的事都瘦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need to work on your half of the church, Mary, looking a bit thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.67,0:29:16.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孤儿没什么其它东西 我也就只有朋友多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, orphan's lot. Friends, that's all I have, lots of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.19,0:29:18.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电子琴表演要在十一点四十八分开始...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Schedule the organ music to begin at precisely 11:48...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.87,0:29:21.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但彩排得是两周之后的事了 冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the rehearsal's not for another two weeks, just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.35,0:29:23.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷静? 我很冷静啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm? I am calm. I'm extremely calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.19,0:29:25.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来安排座位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get back to the reception, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.47,0:29:27.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰的表姐 主桌?\N{\fnArial\fs30}John's cousin, top table?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.27,0:29:29.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她讨厌你 连想都不愿想到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, hates you. Can't even bear to think about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.99,0:29:32.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真的?  - 平邮 廉价明信片\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seriously?  - Second class post, cheap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.99,0:29:36.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在加油站买的 看看邮票 舔了三下贴上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bought at a petrol station. Look at the stamp, three attempts at licking,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.15,0:29:38.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然没意识到留下了口水\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's obviously unconsciously retaining saliva.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.39,0:29:41.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 让她坐厕所旁边好了  - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ah, let's stick her by the bogs.  - Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.67,0:29:44.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有谁讨厌我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else hates me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.03,0:29:48.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.59,0:29:51.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"无价之画被偷" 很有趣的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Priceless painting nicked." Looks interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.67,0:29:53.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 四号桌...  - 已经好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Table four...  - Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.03,0:29:54.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"我的丈夫有三个"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"My husband is three people."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.55,0:29:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 五号桌...  - 詹姆斯·肖尔托少校 他是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Table five...  - Major James Sholto, who he?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.15,0:30:00.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 约翰以前的指挥官 我觉得他不会来  - 他会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John's old commanding officer. I don't think he's coming.  - He'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.55,0:30:02.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他没回复啊  - 他会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, he needs to RSVP, then.  - He'll be there. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.83,0:30:06.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"我的丈夫有三个" 很有趣啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}"My husband is three people." It's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.23,0:30:09.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说他有三种不一样的痣\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says he has three distinct patterns of moles on his skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.31,0:30:12.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三胞胎 百万分之一的出生率 足不出户就解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Identical triplets, one in half a million births. Solved it without leaving the flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.95,0:30:15.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,餐巾... 要天鹅的还是悉尼歌剧院的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, serviettes... Swan or Sydney Opera House?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.47,0:30:18.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你哪学的这些?  - 犯罪调查需要很多技巧...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where did you learn that?  - Many skills are required in the field of criminal investigation...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.11,0:30:21.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 骗人 夏洛克  - 我有次通过餐巾的折纸来破案...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fibbing, Sherlock.  - I once broke an alibi by demonstrating the exact severity of a fold...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.91,0:30:25.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不是约翰 我知道你在撒谎  - 好吧 我在YouTube上学的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not John, I can tell when you're fibbing.  - OK, I learnt it on YouTube.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.99,0:30:28.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悉尼歌剧院 等等 我有电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Opera House, please. Oh, hang on, I'm buzzing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.59,0:30:30.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.23,0:30:34.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 你好 贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hi, Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.71,0:30:36.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 没有什么不可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, I don't see why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.71,0:30:40.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是贝丝 恐怕我得去一下 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, if that's Beth, it's probably for me too, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.71,0:30:48.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他知道我们没有叫贝丝的朋友 他马上就会意识到这是暗号\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows we don't have a friend called Beth, he's going to figure out that it's code.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.51,0:30:50.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他竟然在网上学叠餐巾  - 他考虑很周全\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's YouTubing serviettes.  - He's thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.53,0:30:51.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他吓坏了  - 他才没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's terrified.  - Of course he's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.95,0:30:55.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你害怕一件事的时候 你就会希望它快点结束 通通做完\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're scared of something you start wishing it sooner, just to get it all going.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.59,0:30:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他为什么要害怕我们结婚?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why would he be scared that we're getting married?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.07,0:31:00.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会改变任何事的 我们还是会一起破案\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not going to change anything, we'll still do stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.67,0:31:02.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得证明给他看 我跟你说了 给他找个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to prove it to him. I told you to find him a new case.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.99,0:31:06.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我在努力了  - 你得催促他 给他看看你们曾经的美好时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm trying.  - But you need to run him, OK? Show him it's still the good old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.27,0:31:18.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便就叠好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That just sort of happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.15,0:31:24.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克 嗯 伙计...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, um, mate...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.43,0:31:28.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.51,0:31:31.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我闻了十八种不同的香水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've smelled 18 different perfumes,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.99,0:31:37.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试吃了九种不同的蛋糕 都差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've sampled nine different slices of cake, which all tasted identical.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.87,0:31:40.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望伴娘穿紫色...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the bridesmaids in purple...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.46,0:31:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 丁香紫  - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lilac.  - Lilac.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.87,0:31:44.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有其它什么要准备的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, there are no more decisions left to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.15,0:31:47.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还不明白我们做的这些决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even understand the decisions that we have made.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.27,0:31:49.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我骗人很累的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm faking opinions, and it's exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.35,0:31:55.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请在她回来之前... 找点事做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, please, before she comes back... pick something.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.35,0:31:59.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 随便选一个  - 选什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything. Pick one.  - Pick what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.79,0:32:02.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,案子 你收件箱要爆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A case. Your inbox is bursting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.43,0:32:05.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就... 帮我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just... get me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.15,0:32:07.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要我现在去破案? 现在吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to go out on a case? Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.35,0:32:10.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Sherlock, for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.35,0:32:15.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心了 我会帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you worry about a thing, I'll get you out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.79,0:32:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.67,0:32:20.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"福尔摩斯先生 我叫本布瑞吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dear Mr Holmes, my name is Bainbridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.51,0:32:23.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是女王私人住宅的卫兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a Private in Her Majesty's Household Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.15,0:32:25.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我写信给你是为了一件私事...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm writing to you about a personal matter...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.51,0:32:27.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想跟我上司说这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}one I don't care to bring before my superiors,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.87,0:32:29.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听上去很普通\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would sound so trivial.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.35,0:32:32.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得有人在跟踪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think someone's stalking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.19,0:32:34.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对参观者已经习以为常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm used to tourists, it's part of the job,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.87,0:32:36.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是这个人不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.75,0:32:38.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他监视我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's watching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.27,0:32:43.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每天都来拍我的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's taking pictures of me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.67,0:32:48.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想跟少校说起 但是这真的很扰人"\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to mention it to the Major, but it's really preying on my mind."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.39,0:32:55.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,制服脑残粉? 所有的好姑娘都喜欢士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uniform fetishist? All the nice girls like a soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.35,0:32:59.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是"水手" 而且他认为跟踪他的是个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's "sailor". And Bainbridge thinks his stalker is a bloke.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.35,0:33:01.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去查查吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go and investigate. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.79,0:33:03.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 精英卫兵  - 在职的有40名卫兵及官员\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Elite guard.  - 40 enlisted men and officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.99,0:33:06.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么非是他? 真奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why this particular Grenadier? Curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.27,0:33:08.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.44,0:33:09.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 去吧  - 再见!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK.  - Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.99,0:33:13.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 我们准备去... 我需要夏洛克帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, we're just going to... I need, um, Sherlock to help me
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.23,0:33:15.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 选... 领带  - 袜子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- choose some er... ties.  - Socks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.75,0:33:17.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 要不买袜子吧?  - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why don't we go with socks?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.15,0:33:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说你必须选双好看点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you've got to get the right ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.03,0:33:22.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是的 现在去拿... 领带  - 外套\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Exactly, to go with my... Tie.  - Outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.47,0:33:23.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要一会 是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll take a while, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.94,0:33:25.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我大衣在那吗?  - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is my coat in there?  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.71,0:33:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要带他出去一会 帮他鼓鼓劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just going to take him out for a bit. Run him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.27,0:33:32.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我懂 你说过要给他找个案子  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know. You said you'd find him a case.  - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.63,0:33:34.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 可以走了吗 夏洛克?  - 来了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Coming, Sherlock?  - Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.51,0:33:44.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出租车!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.63,0:34:00.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立定!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Company halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.55,0:34:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向右转!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.55,0:34:10.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来见史蒂芬·本布瑞吉二等兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to see Private Stephen Bainbridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.95,0:34:12.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在站岗 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on duty right now, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.43,0:34:14.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他空闲了我会通知你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll certainly let him know when he's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.47,0:34:15.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概要多久?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.79,0:34:17.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.27,0:34:33.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得他们给他上过课吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think they give them classes?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.43,0:34:34.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,课?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Classes?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.87,0:34:38.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样抵制想要挠后面的冲动\N{\fnArial\fs30}How to resist the temptation to scratch their behinds.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.15,0:34:42.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传入末梢神经的神经冲动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afferent neurons in the peripheral nervous system.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.27,0:34:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屁股痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bum-itch.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.71,0:34:44.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.39,0:34:51.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么不再见他了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't you see him any more?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.71,0:34:54.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谁?  - 你的前指挥官肖尔托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who?  - Your previous commander, Sholto.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.75,0:34:56.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前指挥官?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Previous commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.71,0:34:58.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说前任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meant ex.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.11,0:35:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"前"标明我现在还有长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Previous" suggests that I currently have a commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.51,0:35:02.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我现在没有  - 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which you don't.  - Which I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.51,0:35:03.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当然没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.91,0:35:06.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他被表彰了 是吗? 战争英雄?\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was decorated, wasn't he? A war hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.03,0:35:07.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是每个人都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.59,0:35:10.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他带领一支小队去了战地\N{\fnArial\fs30}He led a team of crows into battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.35,0:35:11.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小队?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crows?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.55,0:35:14.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新兵 入伍必要程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}New recruits. It's standard procedure break the new boys in.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.67,0:35:15.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it went wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.07,0:35:19.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都死了 他是唯一的幸存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all died, he was the only survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.91,0:35:24.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来自死者家庭和媒体的压力不断 他收到的死亡威胁比你还多  - 我可没数过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The press and families gave him hell, he gets more death threats than you.  - Oh, I wouldn't count on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.27,0:35:28.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么突然对另一个人感兴趣了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why have you suddenly taken an interest in another human being?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.11,0:35:29.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在"聊天"\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm "chatting".
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.71,0:35:35.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会再发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be trying that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.87,0:35:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,改变主题...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Changing the subject completely...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.99,0:35:44.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和玛丽结婚不会改变一切的 你明白吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know it won't alter anything, right, me and Mary getting married?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.59,0:35:46.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还是会一起破案\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll still be doing all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.51,0:35:48.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真好  - 我怕你担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, good.  - If you were worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.71,0:35:50.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.03,0:35:53.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.83,0:35:57.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说到玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing about Mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.07,0:35:59.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她彻底改变了我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}she has completely turned my life around.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.39,0:36:02.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,改变了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Changed everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.39,0:36:05.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你得明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, for the record,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.71,0:36:08.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过去这几年里 只有两个人做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}over the last few years there are two people who have done that,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.95,0:36:12.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而这另一个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the other one is...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.87,0:36:14.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个十足的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}a complete dickhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.13,0:37:48.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能问这有什么联系吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask what this is in connection with?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.69,0:37:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本布瑞吉二等兵联系我们帮他解决私事 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Private Bainbridge contacted us about a personal matter, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.76,0:37:55.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我的军队里没有私事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's personal when it concerns my troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.60,0:37:57.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底想要什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you really want?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.68,0:38:00.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来替他请假\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here on a legitimate enquiry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.52,0:38:04.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是媒体的人吗? 想挖一些皇家的八卦新闻?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you press? Digging for some bloody Royal story or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.40,0:38:06.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会 长官 我是约翰华生上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sir, I'm Captain John Watson,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.36,0:38:08.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第五诺森伯兰炮兵团的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifth Northumberland Fusiliers.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.68,0:38:10.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退伍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retired.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.24,0:38:13.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据我所知 你可能只是个二手车推销员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could be a used-car salesman now, for all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.56,0:38:17.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本布瑞吉?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bainbridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.56,0:38:19.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人要见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentleman here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.84,0:38:22.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本布瑞吉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bainbridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.80,0:38:32.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认识你 是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.60,0:38:33.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.48,0:38:38.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在报纸上见过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen you in the papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.96,0:38:41.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟一个带着蠢帽子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hang around with that detective,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.64,0:38:43.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,侦探到处混\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one with the silly hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.04,0:38:47.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本布瑞吉到底找侦探要干嘛?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell does Bainbridge want with a detective?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.52,0:38:49.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没权力告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I'm not at liberty to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.32,0:38:52.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没权力? 他是我的士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not at liberty to say? He's a soldier in my regiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.52,0:38:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他穿着制服做些没意义的事 我就倒霉了  - 长官!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be damned if he's going to get up to cloak-and-dagger nonsense like this.  - Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.20,0:38:58.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了?  - 是本布瑞吉 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on?  - It's Bainbridge, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.84,0:38:59.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.16,0:39:12.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.68,0:39:15.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我看一眼 我是医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! No, let me take a look, sir, I'm a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.64,0:39:16.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.84,0:39:18.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中士 逮捕他!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeant, arrest this man!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.08,0:39:19.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么? 不 不! 我是医生!\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No, no! I'm a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.52,0:39:21.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在又是医生了? 中士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're a doctor now too? Sergeant.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.56,0:39:22.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请让我看看!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me examine him, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.80,0:39:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到个偷偷四处转悠的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, caught this one snooping around.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.76,0:39:26.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是你们的计划?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what this is all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.24,0:39:28.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分散我的注意力 所以他能混进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Distracting me, so that this man could get in here
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.44,0:39:29.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 杀死本布瑞吉?  - 别...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and kill Bainbridge?  - Don't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.88,0:39:32.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 用什么杀他? 凶器在哪?  - 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kill him with what? Where's the weapon?  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.00,0:39:34.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凶器在哪? 随便搜 没有凶器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the weapon? Go on, search me, no weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.36,0:39:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本布瑞吉在站岗 他五分钟前刚下班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bainbridge was on parade, he came off duty five minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.08,0:39:38.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能是我们下的手?\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's this supposed to have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.92,0:39:42.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你肯定在他洗澡前就捅死了他  - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You obviously stabbed him before he got into the shower.  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.20,0:39:46.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没有?!  - 他浑身湿透 头发上还有洗发水 是他进去洗澡后才被捅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No?!  - He's soaking wet and there's shampoo in his hair. He got into the shower, then someone stabbed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.40,0:39:49.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隔间是从里面被锁住的 长官 玻璃是我打破的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cubicle was locked from the inside, sir. I had to break it open.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.16,0:39:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你一定是从上面爬进去的  - 这样我也浑身湿透了 不是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You must have climbed over the top.  - But then I'd be soaking wet too, wouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.76,0:39:55.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少校! 我是约翰·华生 第五诺森伯兰炮兵团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major, please! I'm John Watson, Fifth Northumberland Fusiliers,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.72,0:39:58.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在阿富汗驻守三年 在坎大哈 赫尔曼德\N{\fnArial\fs30}three years in Afghanistan, a veteran of Kandahar, Helmand
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.36,0:39:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴特医院工作过的资深医生!\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Bart's bloody Hospital!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.96,0:40:01.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我去尸检!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me examine this body!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.76,0:40:10.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.36,0:40:12.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自杀?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.20,0:40:13.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 没有凶器 没有刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. The weapon again, no knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.60,0:40:20.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腹部有一处伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, there is a wound to the abdomen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.36,0:40:23.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incredibly fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.52,0:40:26.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被刺死 没有凶器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man stabbed to death, no murder weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.00,0:40:27.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门从里面锁住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Door locked from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.68,0:40:30.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 出入口只有一个  - 夏洛克...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Only one way in or out of here.  - Sherlock...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.56,0:40:32.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗯?  - 他还有呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hmm?  - He's still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.52,0:40:34.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.32,0:40:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 现在怎么办?  - 给我围巾\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do we do?  - Give me your scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.44,0:40:38.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 快点! 叫救护车!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?  - Quickly, now! Call an ambulance!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.76,0:40:40.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 叫救护车!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?  - Call an ambulance, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.76,0:40:42.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.16,0:40:44.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,护士 用力按住这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nurse, press here, hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.68,0:40:46.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 护士?  - 是的 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nurse?  - Yeah, I'm making do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.08,0:40:47.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,压住伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep pressure on that wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.88,0:40:50.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史蒂芬? 史蒂芬 坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stephen? Stephen, stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.16,0:40:54.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本布瑞吉二等兵刚站完岗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Private Bainbridge had just come off guard duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.24,0:40:56.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在那站了四个小时 很多人都看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd stood there for hours, plenty of people watching,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.64,0:40:57.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有什么奇怪的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing apparently wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.88,0:41:00.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下班几分钟后却因为腹部的一个伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came off duty and within minutes was nearly dead
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.28,0:41:02.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差点死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a wound in his stomach,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.44,0:41:03.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但没有凶器\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there was no weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.80,0:41:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凶器去哪了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.56,0:41:07.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们 我请你们想一下...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, I invite you to consider this...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.92,0:41:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凶手如何穿墙逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}a murderer who can walk through walls,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.74,0:41:11.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凶器又如何凭空消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}a weapon that can vanish.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.66,0:41:15.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但在这之中 有一个细节格外值得注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in all of this, there is only one element which can be said to be truly remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.46,0:41:19.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人猜到是什么吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would anyone like to make a guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.78,0:41:23.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.94,0:41:26.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实答案已经在其中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is actually an element of Q&A to all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.82,0:41:32.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏格兰场的 你有想法吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scotland Yard, have you got a theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.46,0:41:36.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 你其实也算半个侦探了 有想法吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you, you're a detective, broadly speaking. Got a theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.62,0:41:38.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 如果...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, um, if the, er...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.38,0:41:39.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果... 如果...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the... If the...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.46,0:41:42.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果凶器能从...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the blade was propelled through the, erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.06,0:41:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通风口的栅栏里伸出来的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}grating in the air vent,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.50,0:41:49.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如弩箭或者弹弓...\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe a ballista or a catapult, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.98,0:41:52.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,体型小的人就能爬进通风口里作案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody tiny could crawl in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.62,0:41:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 凶手可能是个侏儒\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, yeah, we're looking for a dwarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.77,0:41:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.27,0:41:58.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我说对了?  - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really?  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.32,0:41:59.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.02,0:42:00.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stabbed himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.46,0:42:01.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁 是谁说的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.86,0:42:03.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤姆?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.46,0:42:07.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有想法吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.02,0:42:15.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜是自杀 凶器是压缩的骨头和血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attempted suicide, with a blade made of compacted blood and bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.10,0:42:17.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刺穿自己腹部之后就碎掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broke after piercing his abdomen,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.42,0:42:19.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如用肉做的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a meat...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.86,0:42:21.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,匕首\N{\fnArial\fs30}dagger.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.26,0:42:22.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肉做的匕首?\N{\fnArial\fs30}A meat dagger?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.90,0:42:25.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对  - 快坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes.  - Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.10,0:42:27.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.18,0:42:31.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这件棘手的案件中 有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was one feature, and only one feature, of interest
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.54,0:42:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有一个细节很有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the whole of this baffling case,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.46,0:42:37.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坦白地说 那就是平日里的约翰·华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and quite frankly it was the usual John Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.02,0:42:40.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我寻找线索的时候 他却已经拯救了一个生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who, while I was trying to solve a murder, instead saved a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.18,0:42:44.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然有很多怪案值得我思索\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are mysteries worth solving
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.26,0:42:45.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也很多故事值得我讲述\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stories worth telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.82,0:42:49.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是这个我认识的最勇敢的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best and bravest man I know
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.22,0:42:51.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正知道如何做有意义的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, on top of that, he actually knows how to do stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.50,0:42:54.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了准备婚礼和布置现场 他不在行这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except wedding planning and serviettes, he's rubbish at those.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.30,0:42:55.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个案件至今仍是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. The case itself remains
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.78,0:42:59.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有幸遇到过的 最有创意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most ingenious and brilliantly planned murder, or attempted murder,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.26,0:43:01.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是最精巧的谋杀 或者自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've ever had the pleasure to encounter.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.66,0:43:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我所见识的最完美的密室案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most perfect locked-room mystery of which I am aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.66,0:43:07.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然而 我在这里不仅要称赞约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, I'm not just here to praise John,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.58,0:43:09.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要让他羞愧一下 现在我们来讲讲...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm also here to embarrass him, so let's move on to...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.70,0:43:11.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 等一下... 那案件到底是怎么回事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait... How was it done?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.02,0:43:12.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么怎么回事?  - 他怎么被刺的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How was what done?  - The stabbing?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.10,0:43:16.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.70,0:43:18.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那案子我没破成\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't solve that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.90,0:43:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有时也会想不明白 非常非常遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can happen sometimes, it's very, very disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.70,0:43:25.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说起来羞愧 我要讲一讲告别单身庆祝的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Embarrassment leads me on to the stag night.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.22,0:43:27.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 整件事情能说上几小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course there's hours of material here,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.30,0:43:29.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只讲精彩的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I've cut it down to the really good bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.74,0:43:33.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凶案现场在哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murder scenes?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.62,0:43:36.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谋杀现场在哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locations of murders?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.38,0:43:37.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 其实是我们要去扫各种主题酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, pub crawl, themed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.82,0:43:40.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 你们怎么不去地铁站呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but why can't you just do Underground stations?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.34,0:43:43.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那地方没有感觉 我们要去每一个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It lacks the personal touch. We're going to go for a drink in every...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.30,0:43:45.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每一个你发现过尸体的街上喝酒 真有兴致!\N{\fnArial\fs30}In every street where you've found a corpse. Delightful!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.70,0:43:46.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我帮什么忙?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.98,0:43:49.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想喝出毛病 影响心情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't want to get ill. That would ruin it, spoil the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.70,0:43:52.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是化学研究生 就自己不能做实验分析?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a graduate chemist, can't you just work it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.18,0:43:54.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有实际经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lack the practical experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.70,0:43:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是说我爱喝酒?  - 偶尔会喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Meaning you think I like a drink?  - Occasionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.15,0:43:59.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我是个酒鬼?  - 不... 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That I'm a drunk.  - No... No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.66,0:44:06.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看上去... 还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look... well.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.14,0:44:07.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.82,0:44:09.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤姆...\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.94,0:44:13.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.70,0:44:14.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少不是反社会人格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a sociopath.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.82,0:44:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没犯病? 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still? Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.90,0:44:18.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们做爱很多次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're having quite a lot of sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.70,0:44:24.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我想让你计算约翰和我的酒量\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. I want you to calculate John's ideal intake, and mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.26,0:44:26.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好让整晚度得甜蜜一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}to remain in the sweet spot for the whole evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.42,0:44:27.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,头晕... 还行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light-headed... good.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.58,0:44:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在衣柜里小便... 不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Urinating in wardrobes... bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.06,0:44:31.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.34,0:44:33.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两瓶... 啤酒 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two, erm... beers, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.86,0:44:34.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大杯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pints?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.94,0:44:37.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,443.7毫升\N{\fnArial\fs30}443.7 millilitres.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.62,0:44:41.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.06,0:44:47.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么 都计划好了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are we on a schedule?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.10,0:44:50.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会感谢我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.90,0:45:08.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 干杯  - 干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cheers.  - Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.74,0:45:15.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 在那边  - 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Over there.  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.94,0:45:18.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厕所... 现在你随时都会想要去...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toilets... any second now you're going to need...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.22,0:45:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 等一下再告诉我 我想上厕所  - 嗯 我都算好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hang on, tell me after. I need the loo.  - Hmm, on schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.78,0:45:23.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗯?  - 没事 走吧!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eh?  - Nothing. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.54,0:45:30.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 多长时间?  - 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long?  - Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.22,0:45:31.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.70,0:45:35.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,估算大约排放量...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Estimate approximate volume discharge...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.06,0:45:36.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop talking now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.70,0:45:44.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 快点 再来一杯 别让他看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, quick, one more. He mustn't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.70,0:45:55.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你 干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go. Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.82,0:46:03.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我连烟灰都研究! 别说我不懂!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know ash! Don't tell me I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.58,0:46:10.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 够了! 赶紧... 老实站着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, enough! That's... Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.42,0:46:15.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烟灰 我懂烟灰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ash. I know ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.02,0:46:24.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在国际上有声誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an international reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.22,0:46:28.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也有国际声誉吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have an international reputation?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.86,0:46:32.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 我没有国际声誉  - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I don't have an international reputation.  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.94,0:46:36.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想不起来是为什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't even remember what for.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.02,0:46:44.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犯罪... 还是其他什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's crime... something or other.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.94,0:46:49.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 你俩回来干什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what are you doing back?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.18,0:46:50.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为你们要很晚回来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were going to be up late.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.98,0:46:53.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈德太太 现在几点了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Hudders. What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.46,0:46:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们只出去了两小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've only been out two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.54,0:47:09.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是蔬菜吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I a vegetable?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.06,0:47:11.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 还是... 它?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You or the... thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.22,0:47:14.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有意思!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.34,0:47:15.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.58,0:47:17.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快说  - 不 你不是蔬菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on.  - No, you're not a vegetable.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.84,0:47:18.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.46,0:47:21.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.86,0:47:23.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是人吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}am I human?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.94,0:47:25.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.18,0:47:26.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能说有时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't have sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.54,0:47:27.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须是 嗯...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to be, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.74,0:47:31.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是 你是人  - 对 我知道 好吧 我是男的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, you're human.  - Yes, I know, OK. And am I a man?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.34,0:47:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对  - 长得高吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yep.  - Tall?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.46,0:47:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人们想象中那么高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not as tall as people think.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.06,0:47:37.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 人好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.74,0:47:39.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ish.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.22,0:47:40.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聪明吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clever?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.30,0:47:41.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.34,0:47:42.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.62,0:47:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我重要吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, am I important?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.46,0:47:46.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对一些人来说是\N{\fnArial\fs30}To some people.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.02,0:47:48.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们喜欢我吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do people like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.70,0:47:50.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 不 不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erm, no they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.50,0:47:53.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有时候让人觉得尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tend to rub them up the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.54,0:47:55.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.14,0:47:57.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是现任英国国王吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I the current King of England?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.50,0:48:01.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱们哪里有国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know we don't have a King.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.26,0:48:03.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没有国王?  - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't we?  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.42,0:48:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.06,0:48:14.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管了 我是女的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mind. Am I a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.70,0:48:18.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.74,0:48:20.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.98,0:48:23.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我... 漂亮吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I... pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.06,0:48:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这人?\N{\fnArial\fs30}This?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.06,0:48:31.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,审美观完全是由童年时 一个人对模范的印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beauty is a construct based entirely on childhood impressions,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.18,0:48:32.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和所受到的影响造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}influences and role models.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.94,0:48:35.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 那我漂亮吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but am I a pretty lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.94,0:48:41.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不认识你 我不知道你长什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who you are, I don't know who you're supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.50,0:48:42.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你选的名字!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You picked the name!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.70,0:48:44.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我是从报纸上乱选的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I picked it at random from the papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.74,0:48:48.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你其实不会玩这个游戏吧 夏洛克?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not really getting the hang of this game, are you, Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.14,0:48:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是人 我没有人们想象中高 我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I am human, I'm not as tall as people think I am. I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.58,0:48:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我人品还算好 聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm nice-ish, clever,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.70,0:48:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对一些人来说很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}important to some people.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.30,0:48:59.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我有时会让他们觉得尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I tend to rub them up the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.04,0:49:02.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.48,0:49:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是谁  - 我是你 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go on, then.  - I'm you, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.57,0:49:07.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有客户!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Client!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.16,0:49:08.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.48,0:49:10.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好  - 进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello.  - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.68,0:49:13.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们哪位是夏洛克·福尔摩斯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one of you is Sherlock Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.16,0:49:19.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't... a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.84,0:49:22.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从没怎么约会过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I don't date all that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.84,0:49:27.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他看起来挺不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he seemed nice, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.80,0:49:30.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们心有灵犀\N{\fnArial\fs30}We seemed to automatically connect.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.68,0:49:32.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们晚上出去约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had one night,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.12,0:49:35.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后吃饭 谈得很投缘\N{\fnArial\fs30}dinner, such interesting conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.84,0:49:38.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那晚很浪漫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.08,0:49:39.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.60,0:49:42.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还想继续交往下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love to have gone further,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.36,0:49:46.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我想 不 这是恋爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I thought, no, this is special,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.56,0:49:48.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's take it slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.32,0:49:49.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我们交换了电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exchanged numbers,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.88,0:49:52.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说他会继续联系我 结果...\N{\fnArial\fs30}he said he'd get in touch and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.68,0:50:01.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概 他不像我一样渴望这份感情吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he wasn't quite as keen as I was,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.32,0:50:04.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我只想\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I just thought
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.84,0:50:08.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他至少应该给我打一个分手电话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least he'd call to say that we were finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.08,0:50:17.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去了他家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went round there,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.20,0:50:20.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的公寓 完全找不见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}to his flat, no trace of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.52,0:50:24.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯先生 我真觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Holmes, I honestly think
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.96,0:50:29.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己在和鬼魂约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had dinner with a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.16,0:50:34.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯先生?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.96,0:50:41.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和鬼魂约会 福尔摩斯先生!\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a ghost, Mr Holmes!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.88,0:50:44.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无聊 无聊 无聊... 不...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boring, boring, boring... No...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.80,0:50:46.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精彩极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.60,0:50:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰 约翰! 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}John. John! Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.28,0:50:52.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我非常抱歉 我的... 他...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologise about my... You know... Him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.88,0:50:54.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注意礼貌 礼貌!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rude. Rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.92,0:50:58.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我向房主打听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I checked with the landlord
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.04,0:51:01.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果发现住在那的人早就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the man who lived there died.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.24,0:51:03.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心脏病发作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.12,0:51:07.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我们居然一起吃了一星期的晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there we are having dinner one week on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.08,0:51:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我在网上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I found this thing online,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.52,0:51:13.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现了这个聊天室\N{\fnArial\fs30}a sort of chatroom thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.00,0:51:17.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面都些是发现自己和鬼魂约会的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}for girls who think they're dating men from the spirit world.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.24,0:51:20.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心 十分钟之内我就帮你找出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, I'll find him in ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.68,0:51:21.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚说你的狗叫什么来着?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your dog's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.96,0:51:24.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊 你叫我随时就到...  - 约翰 快醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I'm there if you want it...  - John, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.60,0:51:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做梦呢... 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went to... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.12,0:51:28.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游戏... 怎么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game is... something.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.80,0:51:30.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始?\N{\fnArial\fs30}On?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.88,0:51:32.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 对 开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.52,0:51:33.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.90,0:51:45.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.02,0:51:46.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这房子不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice place.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.82,0:51:53.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 发现什么了吗?  - 嗯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See anything?  - Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.94,0:51:55.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么线索吗 福尔摩斯先生?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any clues, Mr Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.42,0:52:20.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先容我把外套脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just going to whip this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.22,0:52:39.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧?  - 恩? 没事 他在找线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right?  - Hmm? Yeah, he's clueing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.51,0:52:39.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.98,0:52:41.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他... 恩? 他在找线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's... Hmm? He's clueing for looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.14,0:52:54.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯先生?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.02,0:53:01.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 福尔摩斯先生!  - 我要叫警察了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr Holmes!  - I'm calling the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.97,0:53:02.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.62,0:53:04.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 别动!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.34,0:53:06.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 这位是著名侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, look, this is a famous detective,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.58,0:53:09.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯 以及他的助手约翰·哈米什·华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's Sherlock Holmes and his partner, John Hamish Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.38,0:53:10.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道自己在做什么吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.18,0:53:13.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't compromise
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.54,0:53:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,破坏...\N{\fnArial\fs30}the integrity of the...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.14,0:53:22.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犯罪现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.58,0:53:30.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.26,0:53:52.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒醒!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakey-wakey!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.10,0:53:53.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.21,0:53:55.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格雷格... 是格雷格吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greg... Is that Greg?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.44,0:53:57.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起来 我得把你俩扔进出租车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up. I'm going to put you two in a taxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.50,0:54:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟接待警员谈妥了事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I managed to square things with the desk sergeant.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.18,0:54:02.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈! 两个不知轻重的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha! What a couple of lightweights,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.70,0:54:04.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们居然没撑到关门!\N{\fnArial\fs30}you couldn't even make it to closing time!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.74,0:54:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你能小点声不?  - 不能!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you whisper?  - Not really!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.14,0:54:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.70,0:54:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks for a...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.06,0:54:29.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know... an evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.42,0:54:30.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.42,0:54:33.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我想装一下来着 不过...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I was going to pretend, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.50,0:54:35.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was, truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.14,0:54:36.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个叫泰瑞莎的女人...\N{\fnArial\fs30}That woman, Tessa...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.54,0:54:37.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.78,0:54:40.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和鬼魂约会 是这几个月以来最有意思的案子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dated a ghost, most interesting case for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.26,0:54:41.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是浪费了大好的机会!\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a wasted opportunity!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.34,0:54:44.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.86,0:54:52.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你感觉如何?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.26,0:54:53.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.02,0:54:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直和以前一样 你坐在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just like old times, having you back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.10,0:55:01.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我感觉是最后一次给你做你最喜欢吃的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I'd make your favourite, one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.38,0:55:04.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 别说的跟生离死别似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Don't sound so final about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.30,0:55:07.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我还会回来看你的  - 哦 你以前也那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will be visiting, you know.  - Ooh, I've heard that one before!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.22,0:55:09.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 这次不一样了 不是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's different now, though, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.26,0:55:11.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们以为他去世了的时候和现在不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's different to when we thought we'd lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.38,0:55:13.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,婚姻会改变一切的 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, marriage changes everything, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.58,0:55:17.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是吗?  - 是啊 你可能想不到 但这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Does it?  - Yeah. You might not think it, but it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.58,0:55:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你人生中一段新的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a different phase in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.66,0:55:20.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会遇到新的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You meet knew people,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.94,0:55:22.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}becauses you're a couple,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.58,0:55:26.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前的友谊就会消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then you just let your old friends slip away.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.54,0:55:29.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不会这样的  - 如果你找到了对的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It won't be like that.  - Well, if you've found the right one,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.74,0:55:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个和你心灵相通的人 那就是世界上最棒的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}the person that you click with, it's the best thing in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.82,0:55:35.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我找到了 我确定那就是她  - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I have. I know I have.  - Oh, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.86,0:55:37.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.06,0:55:39.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我也这么觉得 那你呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think so. What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.38,0:55:40.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.66,0:55:43.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你嫁给哈德森先生的时候 你是觉得你找到了对的人吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you think you'd found the right one when you married Mr Hudson?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.94,0:55:47.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 那就像是一阵旋风\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It was just a whirlwind thing for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.02,0:55:50.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我知道这事不一定靠谱 但我就跟着感觉走了  - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I knew it wouldn't work, but I just got sort of swept along.  - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.30,0:55:52.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来我们去了弗罗里达\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we moved to Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.50,0:55:53.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们共度了美好的时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a fantastic time,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.94,0:55:57.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我不太知道他是做什么的 毒品\N{\fnArial\fs30}but of course I didn't know what he was up to. The drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.18,0:55:59.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 毒品?!  - 他经营着一个 呃...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drugs?!  - He was running, erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.54,0:56:01.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们管它叫什么来着?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what do you call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.50,0:56:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃... 一个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erm... A...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.70,0:56:05.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡特尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}cartel.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.54,0:56:07.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还和一群坏人混在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And got in with a really bad crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.54,0:56:10.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这样啊  - 我还发现他有别的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right.  - And then I found out about all the other women.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.82,0:56:12.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.62,0:56:17.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以当他真的因为杀人被抓起来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, when he was actually arrested for blowing someone's head off,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.02,0:56:20.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说真的 我还真是松了口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was quite a relief, to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.94,0:56:23.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.10,0:56:26.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和弗兰克之间是纯粹的肉体结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was purely physical between me and Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.22,0:56:28.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们根本离不开对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We couldn't keep our hands off each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.58,0:56:31.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 有一个晚上...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, there was one night...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.14,0:56:32.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 是夏洛克回来了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, is that Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.22,0:56:34.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.42,0:56:35.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.70,0:56:42.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Urgh...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.14,0:56:57.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定还有别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are going to be others.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.94,0:57:00.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别人?  - 受害者 女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Others?  - Victims, women.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.98,0:57:03.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大多数鬼魂喜欢在一个地方作祟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most ghosts tend to haunt a single house.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.10,0:57:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个却到处乱转 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ghost, however, is willing to commute. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.18,0:57:28.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.66,0:57:30.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你 不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you. Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.58,0:57:32.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你 也不是你 不是你 不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you. Not you. Not you. Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.78,0:57:34.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你 不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you. Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.90,0:57:36.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.74,0:57:38.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你 不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you. Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.30,0:57:39.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.78,0:57:41.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.42,0:57:44.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你 不是你 不是你 也不是你 不是你 不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you. Not you. Not you. Not you. Not you. Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.82,0:57:47.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你 不是你 不是你 不是你 不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you. Not you. Not you. Not you. Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.22,0:57:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你 不是你 你 你 也不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you, you, you, or you, or you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.38,0:57:52.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是你 不是你 不是你 不是你 不是你 不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or not you, not you, not you, not you, not you, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.66,0:57:55.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.02,0:58:03.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.86,0:58:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是盖尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gail.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.70,0:58:12.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlotte.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.70,0:58:15.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗宾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.46,0:58:19.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vicky.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.66,0:58:29.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是怎么认识的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.74,0:58:31.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 在酒吧里  - 他和我去同一个健身馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Came up to me in a pub.  - Same gym as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.98,0:58:34.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在公交车上闲聊起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just got chatting on the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.02,0:58:35.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,网上认识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Online.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.10,0:58:37.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 叫什么?  - 我刚告诉你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Name?  - Told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.10,0:58:38.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他的名字  - 奥斯卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- His name.  - Oscar.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.90,0:58:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 迈克  - 特里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mike.  - Terry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.78,0:58:43.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃... 可爱的猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erm... Love Monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.34,0:58:45.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在哪约会?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your place?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.10,0:58:46.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他家\N{\fnArial\fs30}His place.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.58,0:58:48.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地址?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Address?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.02,0:58:54.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都没发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.22,0:58:57.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是... 特别浪漫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just... very romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.30,0:59:00.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四个晚上勾搭了四个女人 他一定有什么特别之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four women in four nights. He must have something special.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.02,0:59:01.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他很迷人  - 他善于倾听\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He was very charming.  - He listened.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.70,0:59:02.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他超可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.86,0:59:04.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有可爱的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a lovely...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.18,0:59:06.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.22,0:59:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的饭凉了 哈德森太太又要抱怨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've let your food go cold. Mrs. Hudson will play hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.74,0:59:11.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别打扰我 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.50,0:59:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.50,0:59:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有个可爱的动作\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a lovely manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.10,0:59:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不同的名字 不同的地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}Different names, different addresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.14,0:59:22.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说说他是什么样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Describe him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.50,0:59:23.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金色短发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Short blonde hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.58,0:59:24.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,深色长发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dark hair. Long.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.98,0:59:26.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姜黄色 我喜欢姜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ginger. I like gingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.62,0:59:27.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.82,0:59:29.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他戴着面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a mask on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.70,0:59:33.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在"借尸还魂"\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's stealing the identity of corpses,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.78,0:59:37.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从讣告栏上获得他们的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}getting their names from the obituary columns.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.06,0:59:38.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All single men.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.38,0:59:39.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想到这些死人的公寓会空一阵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's using the dead man's flat
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.82,0:59:42.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以就物尽其用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}under the assumption it will be empty for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.46,0:59:43.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,免费的爱巢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free love nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.82,0:59:44.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想吐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.82,0:59:45.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太阴森了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gruesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.82,0:59:47.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 可怕  - 聪明...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's awful.  - Clever...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.74,0:59:48.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.82,0:59:55.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 泰瑞莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.10,0:59:56.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到正题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile, back to business.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.58,0:59:58.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人想住死人家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one wants to use a dead man's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.74,1:00:01.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住也起码要在它清理干净之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least not until it's been cleared.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.78,1:00:04.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他偷天换日\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, he disguises himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.94,1:00:07.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,借用那个死人的住所和他的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steals the man's home, steals his identity.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.86,1:00:10.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但只借用一晚 然后就消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only for one night. Then he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.50,1:00:12.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是鬼魂 约翰 他是只蜉蝣\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not a ghost, John. He's a Mayfly.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.66,1:00:14.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的生命只有一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lives for a day.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.22,1:00:19.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他想要什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what was it he was looking for?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.14,1:00:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工作?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Job?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.18,1:00:21.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 园丁  - 厨师\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gardener.  - Cook.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.66,1:00:23.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 私人护理  - 我负责安全工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Private nurse.  - I do security work.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.26,1:00:24.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女佣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maid.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.74,1:00:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很明显 你们都为同一个人工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obvious. You all work for the same person.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.10,1:00:44.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不 不是同一个雇主 该死!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, not the same employer. Damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.54,1:00:45.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 我们可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we can do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.94,1:00:47.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完美的约会之夜?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ideal night out?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.06,1:00:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射击粘土鸽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clay-pigeon shooting.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.38,1:00:49.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队列舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Line dancing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.50,1:00:50.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摄影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pictures.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.58,1:00:52.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一边看电视一边喝葡萄酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wine in front of the telly.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.38,1:00:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.18,1:00:57.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 化妆品?  - 娇韵诗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Make-up?  - Clarins.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.02,1:00:58.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,香奈儿七号\N{\fnArial\fs30}No 7.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.42,1:01:00.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 美宝莲  - 基本不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybelline.  - Nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.46,1:01:01.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是便宜货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever's cheap.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.42,1:01:03.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,香水?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfume?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.10,1:01:04.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 香奈儿  - 香奈儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Chanel.  - Chanel.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.44,1:01:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,香奈儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chanel.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.18,1:01:07.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 香奈儿  - 雅诗兰黛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Chanel.  - Estee Lauder.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.82,1:01:10.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理想伴侣?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ideal man?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.26,1:01:11.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔治·克鲁尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}George Clooney.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.54,1:01:13.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 噢...!  - 顾家型\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh...!  - Home-loving.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.06,1:01:15.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要喜欢拥抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd have to like cuddling.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.02,1:01:17.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 细腻敏感  - 十条\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Caring.  - Ten things.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.58,1:01:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一... 他并不与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}One... someone who isn't competitive with other men.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.78,1:01:21.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二... 他不会一直\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two... someone who isn't constantly
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.90,1:01:25.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试图通过男子气概证明自己...\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to define himself by his masculinity...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.38,1:01:27.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一个共同点\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a unifying factor,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.78,1:01:29.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定有\N{\fnArial\fs30}there has to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.22,1:01:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们谁都没说有东西被偷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of you reported anything stolen.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.38,1:01:37.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保安 园丁 厨师 女佣 私人护理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security guard, gardener, cook, maid, private nurse.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.18,1:01:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他虚构的身份是按照等级排序的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's romancing his way up a pecking order.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.06,1:01:42.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,某个人自己心中的等级 快点 好好想 除非...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's pecking order. Come on, think. Unless...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.14,1:01:45.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有没有一个不能对任何人说起的秘密?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a secret you've never told anyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.14,1:01:46.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.66,1:01:48.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 明白了!  - 你什么意思?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gotcha!  - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.54,1:01:51.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都有秘密 而且都会马上否定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone has secrets and they all replied too quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.02,1:01:52.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 走了  - 回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got to go.  - See you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.14,1:01:53.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不... 等等!  - 拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No... Wait!  - Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.37,1:01:53.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.82,1:01:56.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 帅哥 有些秘密只能是秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sexy, some secrets have to stay secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.54,1:01:58.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,享受婚礼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.74,1:02:04.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么? 为什么他和这么多女人约会 但不回她们的电话?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Why would he date all of those women and not return their calls?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.18,1:02:06.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你漏了最显而易见的一点 兄弟  - 有吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're missing the obvious, mate.  - Am I?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.70,1:02:08.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.14,1:02:10.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他为什么要假借他人身份?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why would he change his identity?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.22,1:02:11.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许他已经结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's married.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.58,1:02:14.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.86,1:02:16.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Married.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.54,1:02:17.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的太明显了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obvious, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.66,1:02:19.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的蜉蝣男在试图逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our Mayfly Man was trying to escape
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.38,1:02:21.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让人窒息的家庭生活的围城\N{\fnArial\fs30}the suffocating chains of domesticity
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.10,1:02:23.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不想每天晚上都靠电视打发时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}and instead of endless nights in watching the telly
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.34,1:02:27.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不想和那些他无法忍受的糟糕 可怕 无聊的人聚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}or going to barbecues with the awful, dreadful, boring people he couldn't stand,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.02,1:02:30.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他利用聪明头脑和伪装能力脚踏多条船 他是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}he used his wits, cleverness and powers of disguise to play the field. He was...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.14,1:02:34.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经我再三考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}On second thoughts,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.78,1:02:37.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也许应该告诉你这个显而易见的一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I probably should have told you about the elephant in the room.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.78,1:02:40.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 它更进一步的让我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, it does help to further illustrate
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.42,1:02:42.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰对我来说有多重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}how invaluable John is to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.30,1:02:45.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在人情世故上 华生的才能和我办案能力不相上下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can read a crime scene the way he can understand a human being.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.98,1:02:48.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我过去常想这就是我与众不同的地方 我现在也是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to think that's what made me special, quite frankly I still do.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.94,1:02:50.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是一点忠告\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a word to the wise,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.14,1:02:52.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你们有需要我们帮助的\N{\fnArial\fs30}should any of you require the services of either of us,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.98,1:02:54.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以解决谋杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will solve your murder,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.82,1:02:57.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但只有约翰·华生可以拯救你的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it takes John Watson to save your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.70,1:02:59.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我 我本该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me on that, I should know,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.30,1:03:01.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他屡次三番通过各种方式救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's saved mine so many times and in so many ways.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.98,1:03:07.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一个关于两个男人的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This blog is the story of two men
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.82,1:03:18.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但今天开启了新的篇章\N{\fnArial\fs30}But from now on, there's a new story.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.26,1:03:22.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一场更大的冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bigger adventure.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.78,1:03:25.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.10,1:03:29.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请起立 斟满美酒 并举杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}pray, charge your glasses and be upstanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.70,1:03:31.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天 玛丽·伊丽莎白·华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today begin the adventures
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.46,1:03:39.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在此聚首有两个原因...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two reasons why every single one of us is...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.30,1:03:58.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.46,1:04:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.90,1:04:05.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"约翰·哈米什·华生"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"John Hamish Watson."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.14,1:04:07.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的 你说"哈米什"\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that. You said "Hamish."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.98,1:04:11.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位是著名侦探 夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a famous detective, it's Sherlock Holmes
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.10,1:04:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及他的助手约翰·哈米什·华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his partner, John Hamish Watson.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.90,1:04:14.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.82,1:04:17.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么会知道他的中名的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know his middle name?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.02,1:04:26.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.50,1:04:35.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 亨利?  - 别乱叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Henry?  - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.78,1:04:37.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汉弗莱?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humphrey?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.02,1:04:38.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.54,1:04:41.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希金斯呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Higgins?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.58,1:04:43.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一边去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.66,1:04:46.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很久之后他才告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took him years to confide in me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.34,1:04:48.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,累啊...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.70,1:04:50.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的出生证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my birth certificate.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.46,1:04:51.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.10,1:04:58.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而那个女人... 她也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the woman... she knew.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.54,1:05:02.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是哈米什\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hamish.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.62,1:05:05.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰·哈米什·华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Hamish Watson,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.30,1:05:08.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你们要给小孩取名的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}just if you were looking for baby names.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.34,1:05:10.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼知道她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows where she is.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.98,1:05:16.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚出我的大脑 我很忙!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of my head, I am busy!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.42,1:05:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个名字只被公开过一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one time that name's been made public.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.78,1:05:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要写在邀请函上吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it have to be on the invitation?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.70,1:05:24.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your name.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.70,1:05:26.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是传统...  - 太好笑了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's traditional...  - It's funny...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.54,1:05:31.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,享受婚礼吧...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the wedding...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.70,1:05:37.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,享受婚礼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.14,1:05:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,婚礼 你知道婚礼的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wedding. You knew about the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.26,1:05:41.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更重要的是 说明你看过婚礼请柬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}More importantly, you'd seen a wedding invitation.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.78,1:05:44.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看过请柬的人绝不到一百个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now barely 100 people had seen that invitation.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.02,1:05:46.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而蜉蝣男只见过五个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mayfly Man only saw five women.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.14,1:05:48.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个人两种情况都符合...\N{\fnArial\fs30}For one person to be in both groups...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.30,1:05:49.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}could be a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.90,1:05:52.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.02,1:05:54.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于巧合是怎么说来着?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we say about coincidences?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.22,1:05:55.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙不会这么懒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The universe is rarely so lazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.66,1:05:58.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 所以 最有可能的是?  - 有人不遗余力地\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, the balance of probability is?  - Someone went to great lengths
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.70,1:06:00.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想在婚礼上找到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find out something about this wedding.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.70,1:06:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎样不遗余力?  - 他们撒谎了 谎报身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What great lengths?  - They lied. Assumed false identities.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.06,1:06:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 也就是说?  - 有犯罪动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which suggests?  - Criminal intent.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.02,1:06:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也意味着?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also suggests?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.26,1:06:07.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有情报 有预谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intelligence, planning.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.66,1:06:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然 但更重要的是?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly. But more importantly?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.62,1:06:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蜉蝣男\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mayfly Man.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.14,1:06:15.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蜉蝣男...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mayfly Man is...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.38,1:06:17.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今日在场!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here today!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.58,1:06:20.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, sorry. I...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.86,1:06:23.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来一杯吗 先生?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another glass, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.02,1:06:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 当然 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, yes, thank you. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.82,1:06:27.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有事要发生 就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's going to happen, right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.42,1:06:31.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才说到哪了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where were we?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.54,1:06:32.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随时可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be any second.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.30,1:06:37.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你控制了整个房间的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have control of the room.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.66,1:06:39.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.22,1:06:42.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,举杯起立 非常好 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raising glasses and standing up. Very good. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.34,1:06:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lose it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.78,1:06:46.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请再次落座\N{\fnArial\fs30}And down again.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.02,1:06:55.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.18,1:06:57.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,俗话说好演讲要简短\N{\fnArial\fs30}people tell you not to milk a good speech.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.50,1:06:59.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早点打住 留下欢笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off early, leave 'em laughing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.42,1:07:04.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会谨记的明智建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wise advice I'll certainly try to bear in mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.14,1:07:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for now...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.38,1:07:07.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二场开始!\N{\fnArial\fs30}part two!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.02,1:07:09.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二场动作戏加多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part two is more action-based.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.54,1:07:13.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会四处走动 调整一下状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to walk around, shake things up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.26,1:07:16.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁会参加婚礼呢? 这是关键问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd go to a wedding? That's the question.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.06,1:07:18.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁会大费周章地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would bother to go to any lengths
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.70,1:07:20.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混进婚礼呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get themselves to a wedding?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.34,1:07:23.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个人都会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.94,1:07:29.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也大爱约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}And John's great too.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.46,1:07:32.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远说不够 皮毛都没夸完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't said that enough, barely scratched the surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.10,1:07:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以聊一整晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could go on all night
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.46,1:07:37.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的深度和复杂性\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the depth and complexity of his jumpers,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.78,1:07:40.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且他会做饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he can cook.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.10,1:07:43.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做... 某种东西 有豆子...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does... erm... a thing. A thing with peas...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.90,1:07:47.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只做了一次 或许没有豆子 或许不是他做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once. Might not be peas, might not be him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.14,1:07:50.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他唱歌也很好听 有可能记错人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's got a great singing voice, or somebody does.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.14,1:07:52.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太多了 太多了 太多了 太多了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many, too many, too many, too many!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.78,1:07:56.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 约翰的玩笑说多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, too many jokes about John.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.54,1:07:59.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 现在...  - 犯罪意图\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now...  - Criminal intent.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.54,1:08:01.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说到哪了? 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where was I? Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.22,1:08:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,极其大费周章\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extraordinary lengths.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.06,1:08:04.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,演讲 演讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speech. Speech.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.78,1:08:06.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来谈谈...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk about...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.50,1:08:08.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的一切都预示着...\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of which is suggestive of...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.22,1:08:13.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谋杀! 抱歉 我说谋杀了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murder! Sorry, did I say murder?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.06,1:08:14.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想说婚姻来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meant to say marriage.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.34,1:08:16.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你们理解 如果你仔细想想的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, they're quite similar procedures,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.94,1:08:18.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们的程序极为相似\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.18,1:08:20.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,参加者们都互相认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}The participants tend to know each other
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.02,1:08:21.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因一方去世而结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's over when one of them's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.78,1:08:25.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平心而论 谋杀更快捷 珍宁 这个人怎么样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fairness, murder is a lot quicker though. Janine, what about this one?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.26,1:08:29.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相貌还行? 关键是 他的女朋友穿着不舒服的新内衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acceptably hot? More importantly, his girlfriend's wearing new uncomfortable underwear
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.26,1:08:33.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都懒得捡他外套上的线头 或者指出他脖子上的油污\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hasn't bothered to pick this thread off his jacket, or point out the grease smudge on his neck.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.42,1:08:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会独自回家 还是个漫画和科幻小说迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going home alone. Also he's a comics and sci-fi geek,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.06,1:08:39.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种人都很有感激心 值得你花时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're always tremendously grateful, really put the hours in.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.02,1:08:40.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰夫 去男厕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeff, the gents.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.66,1:08:41.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上去洗手间 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loos now, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.94,1:08:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 叫我格雷格  - 洗手间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Greg.  - The loos, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.90,1:08:47.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么?  - 我怎么知道 或许轮到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why?  - Oh, I don't know, maybe it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.22,1:08:50.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说到这个 我还真想去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, actually, now you mention it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.14,1:08:52.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克 这演讲... 什么时候结束?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, any chance of a... an end date for this speech?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.94,1:08:54.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该切蛋糕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to cut the cake.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.02,1:08:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.06,1:08:58.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就受不了我终于有机会当众演讲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}can't stand it when I finally get the chance to speak for once.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.82,1:09:00.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梵蒂冈的配角\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vatican cameos.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.14,1:09:02.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说什么? 这什么意思?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he say? What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.06,1:09:04.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战斗状态 有人要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Battle stations, someone's going to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.02,1:09:05.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.38,1:09:09.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缩小范围 缩小范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Narrow it down. Narrow it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.34,1:09:12.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缩小范围!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Narrow it down!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.14,1:09:13.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.90,1:09:16.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.74,1:09:20.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你 一直是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. It's always you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.94,1:09:23.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰·华生 你保证我不走弯路\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Watson, you keep me right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.34,1:09:26.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该怎么做?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.62,1:09:28.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've already done it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.26,1:09:30.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要想着破案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't solve the murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.38,1:09:31.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想着救人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save the life.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.58,1:09:34.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 有点跑题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, off piste a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.06,1:09:35.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到正题 咻!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back now. Phew!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.38,1:09:38.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们玩个游戏吧 叫"杀人游戏"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's play a game. Let's play murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.70,1:09:40.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.82,1:09:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想象有人会在婚礼上被谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine someone's going to get murdered at a wedding.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.70,1:09:45.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们会选谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who exactly would you pick?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.06,1:09:48.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定是热门人选 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're a popular choice at the moment, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.06,1:09:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有人把哈德森太太的眼镜放到她够不到的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}If someone could move Mrs Hudson's glass just slightly out of reach,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.06,1:09:52.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那将感激不尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}that would be lovely.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.06,1:09:56.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更重要的是 谁只能在婚礼上被杀?\N{\fnArial\fs30}More importantly, who could you only kill at a wedding?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.70,1:09:59.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大多数人在任何一个地方杀死都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people you can kill any old place.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.42,1:10:00.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为思想训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a mental exercise,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.50,1:10:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我经常策划谋杀朋友和同事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've often planned the murder of friends and colleagues.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.90,1:10:04.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 我要毒死约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, John, I'd poison.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.02,1:10:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃货很容易死 我会给他吃化学药剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sloppy eater, dead easy. I've given him chemicals and compounds,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.10,1:10:08.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样他根本注意不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}that way he's never even noticed.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.58,1:10:10.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有次昏睡了整个周三 毫无头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He missed a whole Wednesday once, didn't have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.82,1:10:14.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谋杀雷斯垂德太容易了 至今没人试过真是奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lestrade's so easy to kill it's a miracle no-one's succumbed to the temptation.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.38,1:10:18.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有哥哥家的钥匙 心血来潮的时候可以闯入掐死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got keys to my brother's house, I could break in and asphyxiate him, if the whim arose.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.26,1:10:20.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他生气了 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's pissed, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.06,1:10:21.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, once again,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.62,1:10:24.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁是你只能在这杀死的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}who could you only kill here?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.18,1:10:25.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然这是难得的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly it's a rare opportunity,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.74,1:10:27.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以是一个不经常露面的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it's someone who doesn't get out much.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.70,1:10:29.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤其是他提前好几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone for whom a planned social encounter
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.62,1:10:31.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道有社交活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}known about months in advance is an exception.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.86,1:10:33.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对他有特殊意义的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has to be a unique opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.90,1:10:37.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由于在公众场合杀人非常困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since killing someone in public is difficult,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.18,1:10:39.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而又不能私下里动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}killing them in private isn't an option.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.34,1:10:42.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那这个人应该住在无法接近或者不知名的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone who lives in an inaccessible or unknown location, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.74,1:10:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许是个隐士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone private perhaps,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.46,1:10:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,极度关注个人安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}obsessed with personal security.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.94,1:10:49.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许还受过威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly someone under threat.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.46,1:10:56.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯·肖尔托少校 他是谁?  - 我觉得他不会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Major James Sholto, who he?  - I don't think he's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.98,1:10:57.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.98,1:10:59.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些年你住在哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you living these days?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.86,1:11:01.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很偏僻的小地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, way out in the middle of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.94,1:11:03.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来自死者家庭和媒体的压力不断\N{\fnArial\fs30}The press and families gave him hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.54,1:11:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他收到的死亡威胁比你还多\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gets more death threats than you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.78,1:11:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个隐士?\N{\fnArial\fs30}A recluse?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.82,1:11:10.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小型王室的职员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small household staff.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.86,1:11:12.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 工作?  - 园丁 厨师 私人护士 女佣\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Job?  - Gardener. Cook. Private nurse. Maid.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.94,1:11:14.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,额外的安保薪酬很高\N{\fnArial\fs30}High turnover for additional security.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.94,1:11:17.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我负责安保工作  - 或许都签了保密协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I do security work.  - Probably all signed confidentiality agreements.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.98,1:11:20.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们有不可告人的秘密吗?  - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you have a secret you've never told anyone? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.42,1:11:23.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但仍然有个问题 大问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is another question that remains. Rather a big one,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.02,1:11:25.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常大... 会怎么做? 怎么当众杀人呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}a huge one... how would you do it? How do you kill someone in public?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.70,1:11:27.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定有办法 都计划好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has to be a way. This has been planned.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.50,1:11:29.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 福尔摩斯先生!  - 你好 阿奇 你怎么想的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr Holmes!  - Hello, Archie, what's your theory?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.54,1:11:31.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回答正确就把无头修女给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this right and there's a headless nun in it for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.98,1:11:34.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 隐形人可以做到  - 人物 情节 起因 时间 地点?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The invisible man could do it.  - The who, what, why, when, where?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.70,1:11:39.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隐形人拿着隐形的刀 就是想杀死卫兵的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The invisible man with the invisible knife. The one who tried to kill the Guardsman.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.18,1:11:56.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本布瑞吉?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bainbridge?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.34,1:11:58.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本布瑞吉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bainbridge!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.58,1:12:09.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 不只是有计划... 还彩排过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, not just planned... planned and rehearsed.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.10,1:12:11.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.22,1:12:12.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在有个小插曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}there will now be a short interlude.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.86,1:12:14.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬新娘和新郎...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bride and groom...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.66,1:12:19.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬新娘和新郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bride and groom.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.62,1:12:23.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肖尔托少校将被杀害 我不知道是谁 会怎么下手 但这事情肯定会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major Sholto's going to be murdered, I don't know how or by whom, but it's going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.38,1:12:25.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 让路 私下商议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, coming through. Consulting.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.94,1:12:27.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 待在这  - 一定要小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay here.  - Please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.94,1:12:30.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 让下路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Coming through.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.46,1:12:32.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.94,1:12:35.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 又来一个 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, one more. Oops. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.14,1:12:36.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.62,1:13:04.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么会记不得哪个房间? 你过目不忘啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you not remember which room? You remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.66,1:13:07.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我得清理内存!  - 是207\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have to delete something!  - 207.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.10,1:13:17.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肖尔托少校? 肖尔托少校!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major Sholto? Major Sholto!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.82,1:13:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 肖尔托少校!  - 如果有人想取我的性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Major Sholto!  - If someone's about to make an attempt on my life,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.42,1:13:24.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也不是第一次了 我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it won't be the first time. I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.86,1:13:26.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 少校 让我们进去  - 把门踹开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Major, let us in.  - Kick the door down.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.86,1:13:28.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会开门的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.06,1:13:32.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我手里有把枪 还有一辈子的不幸回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a gun in my hand and a lifetime of unfortunate reflexes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.62,1:13:35.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在里面不安全 不管是谁要杀你 锁上门是不够的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not safe in there. Whoever's after you, we know a locked room doesn't stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.98,1:13:37.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿着隐形刀的隐形人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The invisible man with the invisible knife.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.94,1:13:41.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不知道他的手法 我阻止不了他 而这意味着他还会动手的!  - 那就破解它!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know how he does it. I can't stop him and that means he'll do it again!  - Solve it, then!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.78,1:13:43.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.62,1:13:46.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是大名鼎鼎的福尔摩斯先生 开始破案吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the famous Mr Holmes, solve the case, on you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.74,1:13:49.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我他的手法 我会开门的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me how he did it and I'll open the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.38,1:13:51.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托 现在没时间玩游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, this is no time for games,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.66,1:13:53.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们进去 你很危险!\N{\fnArial\fs30}just let us in, you're in danger!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.14,1:13:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在这里也很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are you, so long as you're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.70,1:13:57.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你们了 别管我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, leave me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.62,1:14:01.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使我有官衔 我也不希望拖累他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite my reputation, I really don't approve of collateral damage.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.14,1:14:03.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那就破案  - 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Solve it.  - Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.44,1:14:04.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像他说的 只要你破案 他就会开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solve it and he'll open the door, like he said.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.34,1:14:07.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 以前我解不开 现在为什么就能解开?  - 因为现在需要解开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I couldn't solve it before, how can I solve it now?  - Because it matters now.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.58,1:14:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么呢? 她在说什么呢? 好好管管你老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? What's your wife talking about? Get your wife under control!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.12,1:14:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.62,1:14:12.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你怎么说变就变!  - 不 她是对的 别说了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, you've changed!  - No, she is. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.50,1:14:14.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是一个解密者 从来不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not a puzzle-solver, you never have been.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.78,1:14:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只会作秀!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a drama queen!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.90,1:14:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在有人要死了 游戏开始... 赶紧破案!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, there's a man in there about to die, the game is on... solve it!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.42,1:14:36.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本布瑞吉?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bainbridge?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.22,1:14:40.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本布瑞吉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bainbridge!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.82,1:14:46.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 实话实说 他也很会作秀  - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Though in fairness, he's a drama queen too.  - I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.18,1:14:48.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肖尔托少校 没人会来杀你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major Sholto, no one's coming to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.26,1:14:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几小时前你就已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid you've already been killed several hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.06,1:14:52.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.22,1:14:53.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要解开腰带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take off your belt.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.78,1:14:55.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腰带?\N{\fnArial\fs30}My belt?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.30,1:14:56.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 就是腰带\N{\fnArial\fs30}His belt, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.42,1:14:58.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还没到 本布瑞吉就被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bainbridge was stabbed hours before we even saw him,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.82,1:15:00.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实是被他的腰带刺杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was through his belt.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.38,1:15:02.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紧系在腰部的腰带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tight belt, worn high on the waist.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.22,1:15:04.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很轻易就能将刀片刺入腹部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very easy to push a small blade through the fabric
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.22,1:15:05.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至都察觉不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you wouldn't even feel it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.46,1:15:08.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腰带系着的时候察觉不到伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}The belt would bind the flesh together when it was tied tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.34,1:15:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没错  - 但解开的时候...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Exactly.  - But when you took it off...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.88,1:15:10.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伤口迸发 行刺成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delayed-action stabbing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.94,1:15:13.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样不在场证明就能轻易伪造 肖尔托少校?\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the time in the world to create an alibi. Major Sholto?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.82,1:15:15.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.90,1:15:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被自己的军装杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was to be killed by my uniform.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.18,1:15:23.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是讽刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}How appropriate.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.58,1:15:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他破案了 少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}He solved the case, Major,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.06,1:15:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要把门打开 我们说好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're supposed to open the door now. A deal is a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.06,1:15:32.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来应该上交军装\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not even supposed to have this any more,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.10,1:15:34.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他们特别照顾我 让我留着它\N{\fnArial\fs30}they gave me special dispensation to keep it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.22,1:15:36.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道脱掉军装我还能做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't imagine life out of this uniform.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.54,1:15:39.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在看起来 我可以不脱掉它们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose, given the circumstances, I don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.58,1:15:43.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然那么多人希望我死\N{\fnArial\fs30}When so many want you dead,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.94,1:15:45.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,磨磨蹭蹭又有什么用呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}it hardly seems good manners to argue.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.54,1:15:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你在做什么 詹姆斯 立刻停下来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you're doing in there, James, stop it, right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.34,1:15:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要破门而入了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will kick this door down!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.06,1:15:58.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯先生 我认为我们很像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Holmes, you and I are similar, I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.98,1:16:01.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是的 我同意  - 当死则死 我说得对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, I think we are.  - There's a proper time to die, isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.78,1:16:03.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course there is.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.10,1:16:06.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当死亡来临的时候不应该逃避\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one should embrace it when it comes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.82,1:16:07.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要像战士一样面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a soldier.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.86,1:16:10.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话是没错 但不应该在约翰的婚礼上死!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course one should, but not at John's wedding!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.82,1:16:14.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和我都不会那么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wouldn't do that, would we,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.54,1:16:16.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and me?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.86,1:16:19.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能这么对约翰·华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would never do that to John Watson.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.74,1:16:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要踹门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to break it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.10,1:16:28.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 你不用那样做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, you won't have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.42,1:16:37.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我需要医疗救助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe I am in need of medical attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.06,1:16:39.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe I'm your doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.46,1:16:57.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.70,1:16:59.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是旋转的时候要注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hold your nerve on your turning.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.78,1:17:01.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们干嘛要彩排?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do we have to rehearse?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.46,1:17:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们要在众人面前跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we are about to dance together in public
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.70,1:17:05.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你舞技不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your skills are appalling.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.82,1:17:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你真是个好老师  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow, you're a good teacher.  - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.82,1:17:10.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且很会跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're a brilliant dancer.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.66,1:17:12.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想不想知道我的秘密 珍宁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I let you in on something, Janine?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.54,1:17:14.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.02,1:17:16.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢跳舞 一直都很喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love dancing, I've always loved it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.10,1:17:17.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的假的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.18,1:17:18.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.18,1:17:24.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.70,1:17:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然目前对于办案没什么帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never really comes up in crime work, but, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.06,1:17:29.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 但我希望有天能碰上一个这样的案子  - 哦 真希望你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I live in hope of the right case.  - Oh, I wish you weren't...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.94,1:17:33.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是现在的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever it is you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.10,1:17:35.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是的  - 真是太好了 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know.  - Well, glad to see you've pulled, Sherlock,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.94,1:17:38.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你解开了我婚礼上的凶杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}what with murderers running riot at my wedding.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.78,1:17:40.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起谋杀案... 一起未遂的谋杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}One murderer... one nearly murderer.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.46,1:17:42.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就喜欢夸张... 你应该试试和他住在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loves to exaggerate... you should try living with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.86,1:17:44.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.38,1:17:46.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把他带来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got him for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.14,1:17:49.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照相师 很好 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, the photographer, excellent. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.26,1:17:51.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以看一眼你的照相机吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I have a look at your camera?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.62,1:17:54.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 怎么了? 我都快到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erm, what's this about? I was halfway home.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.62,1:17:56.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快点开车就已经到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have driven faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.90,1:17:59.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 很好!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.46,1:18:01.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.22,1:18:03.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了吗... 棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you see... perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.82,1:18:06.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事? 你能解释一下吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is? Are you going to tell us?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.22,1:18:07.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自己看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try looking yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.46,1:18:12.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看什么?  - 凶手在照片里吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look for what?  - Is the murderer in these photographs?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.74,1:18:14.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不在照片里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what's in the photographs,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.54,1:18:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一张他的照片也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's what's not in them. Not in any of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.62,1:18:17.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.90,1:18:20.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们谈过了 别总显摆...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The showing-off thing, we've discussed it before...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.94,1:18:25.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,婚礼上有个人永远都不会在照片里露脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is always a man at a wedding who is not in any photograph,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.50,1:18:27.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想去哪里都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}who can go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.30,1:18:30.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还可以带着一个工具包\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even carry an equipment bag around with him if he likes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.10,1:18:32.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照片不会拍下他的长相\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you never even see his face.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.06,1:18:33.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家只会看到...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only ever see...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.46,1:18:43.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他照的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}the camera.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.74,1:18:45.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干嘛? 怎么回事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.26,1:18:47.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳森·斯莫尔 今天的临时婚礼摄影师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonathan Small, today's substitute wedding photographer,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.90,1:18:49.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是我们说的蜉蝣男\N{\fnArial\fs30}known to us as the Mayfly Man.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.78,1:18:54.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的弟弟就是在那次行动中牺牲的新兵之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}His brother was one of the raw recruits killed in that incursion.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.50,1:18:56.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳森一直想找肖尔托复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny sought revenge on Sholto,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.58,1:18:58.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想法设法接近肖尔托\N{\fnArial\fs30}worked his way through Sholto's staff,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.90,1:19:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他发现了可乘之机\N{\fnArial\fs30}found what he needed.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.10,1:19:02.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,婚礼请柬\N{\fnArial\fs30}An invitation to a wedding.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.30,1:19:05.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次肖尔托一定会公开露面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one time Sholto would have to be out in public.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.82,1:19:09.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他制定了计划 还进行了预演\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he made his plan and rehearsed the murder,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.62,1:19:13.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确保每个环节万无一失\N{\fnArial\fs30}making sure of every last detail.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.34,1:19:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精密而残酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brilliant, ruthless,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.90,1:19:28.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且疯狂的偏执\N{\fnArial\fs30}and almost certainly a monomaniac.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.82,1:19:31.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但说实话 他的摄影技巧确实不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though, in fairness, his photographs are actually quite good.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.82,1:19:33.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要这个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you need is on that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.42,1:19:36.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许应该逮捕他 随你便\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably ought to arrest him or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.46,1:19:38.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直随身携带手铐吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you always carry handcuffs?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.58,1:19:40.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 低调 妹子  - 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Down, girl.  - Come on, quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.62,1:19:43.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该被捕的人不是我 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not me you should be arresting, Mr Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.10,1:19:45.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能逮捕别人 是别人来做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I don't do the arresting, I just farm that out.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.66,1:19:47.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肖尔托才是杀人犯 不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sholto, he's the killer, not me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.86,1:19:50.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该快刀斩乱麻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have killed him quicker.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.70,1:19:54.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不应该耍那些小聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have tried to be clever.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.98,1:19:57.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该快点开车回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have driven faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.10,1:20:08.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.02,1:21:29.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, just one last thing
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.02,1:21:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在舞会之前 我想先说几句\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the evening begins properly.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.06,1:21:34.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对于今天早些时候的小插曲 我深表抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies for earlier, a crisis arose and was dealt with.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.82,1:21:36.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那些都不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}More importantly, however,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.82,1:21:38.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为今天一对新人在这里盟誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}today we saw two people make vows.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.70,1:21:40.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从没有 今后也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never made a vow in my life
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.14,1:21:41.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,许下任何承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}and after tonight I never will again.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.90,1:21:44.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以今天在大家面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, here in front of you all,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.10,1:21:45.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我将许下今生唯一的承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}my first and last vow.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.02,1:21:49.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽和约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary and John,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.02,1:21:50.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论今后\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever it takes,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.82,1:21:52.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever happens,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.82,1:21:54.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从此刻开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}from now on,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.18,1:21:56.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都会守护你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear I will always be there.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.70,1:21:58.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.06,1:21:59.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会守护着你们三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all three of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.46,1:22:01.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃... 不好意思... 你们二个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erm... sorry, I mean... I mean two of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.94,1:22:04.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们二个 你们两个 不好意思 我数学不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All two of you. Both of you, in fact. I just miscounted.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.46,1:22:06.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 该跳舞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, it's time for dancing.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.34,1:22:08.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请接着演奏 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play the music again, please. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.18,1:22:10.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 大家尽情跳吧 不要拘束\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, everybody, just dance, don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.22,1:22:12.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都跳起来 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dancing, please. Very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.30,1:22:15.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不应该多说了一个人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, that was one more deduction than I was really expecting.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.06,1:22:16.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 多说?  - 食欲大增...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Deduction?  - Increased appetite...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.78,1:22:18.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要饿死了  - 口味改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm starving.  - Change of taste perception.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.74,1:22:20.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么会选这种酒 真是难喝得要命!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I chose this wine, but it's bloody awful!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.90,1:22:22.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上你还恶心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were sick this morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.18,1:22:23.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为那只是婚礼前的紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}You assumed it was just wedding nerves.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.86,1:22:26.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟你说的时候 你还冲我发火\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got angry with me when I mentioned it to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.02,1:22:29.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 所有一切都表明了  - 表明什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All the signs are there.  - The signs?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.22,1:22:31.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预示着有新生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The signs of three.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.18,1:22:33.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.06,1:22:34.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽 你应该去验一下孕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary, I think you should do a pregnancy test.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.06,1:22:39.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怀孕初期的检验结果应该是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the statistics for the first trimester are...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.18,1:22:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.70,1:22:42.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.98,1:22:44.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.18,1:22:46.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么他比我先看出来?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did he notice before me?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.34,1:22:48.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我可是医生  - 今天你休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm a bloody doctor.  - It's your day off.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.52,1:22:48.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才应该去休息!\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your day off!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.92,1:22:49.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. Stop panicking.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.94,1:22:51.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不紧张  - 怀孕的是我 我很紧张!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not panicking.  - I'm pregnant, I'm panicking!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.64,1:22:52.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.74,1:22:54.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都不要紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of you panic.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.38,1:22:56.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全没必要紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely no reason to panic.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.14,1:23:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 就像你懂似的!  - 我当然懂 你们肯定是最棒的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, and you'd know, of course!  - Yes, I would. You're already the best parents in the world,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.10,1:23:02.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们准备得这么充分  - 准备什么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- look at all the practice you've had.  - What practice?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.62,1:23:06.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们已经成功地把我养到这么大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're hardly going to need me around now that you've got a real baby on the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.18,1:23:16.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧?  - 很好!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you all right?  - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.94,1:23:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们俩去跳舞吧  - 嗯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dance. Both of you now, go, dance.  - Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.10,1:23:29.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们站在这里 大家都会好奇我们在说什么  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can't just stand here, people will wonder what we're talking about.  - Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.38,1:23:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你怎么办?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.62,1:23:34.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们三个人不能一起跳舞  - 是的 咳咳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, we can't all three dance, there are limits.  - Yes, there are. Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.06,1:23:35.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 老公 我们跳舞去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, husband, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.94,1:23:37.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这不是华尔兹吧?  - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This isn't a Waltz, is it?  - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.98,1:23:39.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心 我教过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, I have been tutoring him.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.70,1:23:43.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 在贝克街 我们拉上窗帘在屋里跳舞 有一次哈德森太太看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did, you know. Baker Street, behind closed curtains. Mrs Hudson came in one time.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.38,1:23:45.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后绯闻就传开了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how those rumours started!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.78,1:23:51.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我转过头去 不由自主 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Spinnin' my head around and taking my body under ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.82,1:23:55.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 哦 多么美好的夜晚 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, what a night ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.14,1:24:01.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 哦 多么美好的夜晚 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, what a night ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.54,1:24:14.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 哦 我已经 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, I ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.98,1:24:18.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 感受到了那种冲动 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I got a funny feelin' when she walked ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.74,1:24:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 在她进来的时候 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ In the room ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.78,1:24:23.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 嘿 但是 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Hey, I ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.18,1:24:27.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 那种感觉稍纵即逝 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ As I recall it ended much too soon ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.42,1:24:33.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 哦 多么美好的夜晚 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, what a night ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.22,1:24:36.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 为什么我这么晚才明白 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Why'd it take so long to see the light ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.98,1:24:41.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 看似模糊 其实我明白 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Seemed so wrong but now it seems so right ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.94,1:24:46.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 多么美丽的姑娘 多么美好的夜晚 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ What a lady, what a night ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.70,1:25:03.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 哦 我被电到了 就像被闪电击中一样 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, I felt a rush like a rolling ball of thunder ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.46,1:25:07.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我转过头去 不由自主 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Spinnin' my head around and taking my body under ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.14,1:25:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 哦 多么美好的夜晚 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, what a night ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.62,1:25:15.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 哦 多么美好的夜晚 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, what a night ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.66,1:25:18.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 哦 多么美好的夜晚 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, what a night ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.62,1:03:10.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是一场关于谋杀 悬案和故意伤害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and their, frankly, ridiculous adventures
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.70,1:03:13.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,荒诞冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}of murder, mystery and mayhem.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.74,1:03:33.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和约翰·哈米什·华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Mary Elizabeth Watson
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.84,1:03:35.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将开始他们新的冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}and John Hamish Watson.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.02,1:04:19.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很讨厌这名字 从不告诉别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never tells anyone, he hates it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.70,1:04:24.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰·H·华生?\N{\fnArial\fs30}John "H" Watson?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.62,1:07:25.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,婚礼多棒啊 大爱婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weddings are great, love a wedding.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.93,1:07:27.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他在干嘛?  - 出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's he doing?  - Something's wrong.
